  "22test06.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_nfttrophy22.png",
  "22test06.text": "Hey!\\n\\nYou've been picked to receive a Bronze Community Pillar NFT for your contributions to the Habbo community. To receive the NFT, you need to do three things:\\n\\n1) Sign up for MetaMask. Check this guide to see how to do this.\\n\\n[https://nft.habbo.com/info/#metamask|Click here] [https://nft.habbo.com/info/#metamask|Click here]\\n\\n2) Connect your MetaMask to IMX. [https://nft.habbo.com/info/#imx|Click here] to see a guide on how to do this: 3) Enter your MetaMask wallet address in the poll\\n\\n[https://nft.habbo.com/info/#tab2|Here's] a guide showing how to use NFT furni in Habbo\\n\\n",
  "22test06.title": "Bronze Community Pillar NFT",
  "23april01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_ecocityfire.png",
  "23april01.text": "After experiencing huge growth over the past years, things in Sunlight City have taken a turn for the worse. The peace that its citizens have experienced for many years is at risk by the attack of robot animals. No one knows why all of a sudden these robots have started attacking people.\\n\\nYou'll look into who's behind all this at a later point, now you need to focus on helping the Sunlight citizens find a safe place to be in.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- You have 30 seconds to get inside the game before the sci-fi door closes.\\n- Stay on the tiles to avoid falling into the empty space. The tiles will change to red before they disappear out of the game area. Make sure to stay focus and move quickly in order not to lose.\\n- If you manage to be the last person standing, step quickly on the green tile that will appear to win the prizes.",
  "23april01.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april02.1.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_robotmachine.png",
  "23april02.1.text": "Now that the machine has stopped working you need to help the people in the city find a safe place to hide.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Move around the color tiles placed in the game and avoid getting hit by the robotic animals that are moving towards you.\\n- Survive for 45 seconds to win.",
  "23april02.1.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_robotmachine.png",
  "23april02.text": "Isaac, Ada and Samuel are the 3 scientists responsible for developing the new bio-inspired robots. Their initial purpose was to create robots that could be used for research and experimentation, unfortunately one of these scientists has altered robots behavior to use them for their own benefit.\\n\\nGet to know a bit more about them and see if you can figure out who's behind the hacking of the robots\\n\\n- Isaac: He's the scientist in charge of the project. He's originally from the UK where he became a chemist. He's been working as a consultant for the government for the past 5 years.\\n- Ada: She's one of Poland's most famous environmental scientists. She has spent the last 2 years working on developing new kinds of renewable energy sources.\\n- Samuel: He graduated as an environmental engineer in Berlin's University of Applied Science. His main focus has always been finding solutions to the different environmental issues that affect our world.\\n\\nYour task this time will be to enter the game and shut down the machine to stop more robotic animals from being created.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Step on the gray squares and type * to cut all the cables that make the machine work.\\n- Watch out for the Mecha Bunny if you get too close to it, you'll immediately lose.\\n- When you're done, sit on the stool in front of the solarpunk computer and say **hack** to complete the game.\\n\\n- Use the teleport to go to the next room.",
  "23april02.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_sciencelab23.png",
  "23april03.text": "You have now found yourself inside the Science Center. Your objective this time is to find the secret lab used by one of the scientists to control the army of evil robot animals that are attacking the city.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Take one of the two teleports in the room to discover the different rooms in the Science Center.",
  "23april03.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_sciencelab23.png",
  "23april04.text": "You found the final room but unfortunately it is not the secret lab... Put your playing skills to the test and see if you can make it past the booby traps left in the room.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Cross the street and turn the red tiles green by stepping on them. Every time you make it to the other side you'll need to pull the lever next the to block number to win a point.\\n- In order to complete the game you'll need to get 3 points before the timer ends. Once you've reached *3 points*, pull the lever again to collect your prizes.",
  "23april04.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april05.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_sciencelab23.png",
  "23april05.text": "You've found a research facility that could lead you to the hidden laboratory. See if you can break the code to enter the next room.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Walk on the white tiles to copy the colors set on the colored square.\\n- You have 60 seconds to copy the colors on the empty tiles.\\n- When you're done, walk down the stairs and take the teleport to the next room.",
  "23april05.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april06.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_sciencelab23.png",
  "23april06.text": "Enter the lab and see if you can find out what kind of experiments were being developed in this abandoned lab and which scientist was behind the hacking of the robotic animals.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n - Go up the stairs and step on the color tile to start the game.\\n - In the first part of the game you need to get 4 points by stepping on the colors that match the tile next to the block number. The colors in the tile will change quickly so you need be to fast.\\n- When you're done, walk down the stairs and step on the white tile next to the cage to start the second game.\\n - Step on the broken cables and type * to connect them back together.\\n - When you're done, pull the lever and walk quickly towards the ring plate that will appear in the room to collect your prizes.",
  "23april06.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april07.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_powerroomgame.png",
  "23april07.text": "Access the Science Center's power room and shut down the generators to stop all the machines in the building from working.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Walk around the room and find the correct lever that will shut down the generators. Everytime you use one of the right levers, a green light will turn on.\\n- You have 1 minute to find the levers. When you're done, use the teleport to go to the next room and collect your prizes.",
  "23april07.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23april08.image": "web_promo_small//spromo_sciencelab23.png",
  "23april08.text": "Now that you've gained access to the secret lab it's time to destroy it to prevent more robots from being developed.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Walk towards the Medicine Cabinet by Frank's portrait and grab a Habbo cola from it that will serve as fuel. Make sure to walk away from the cabinet with the correct hand item. (You may need to click on it a few times to get the Habbo cola)\\n- Step on the red tiles and type * to set the different parts of the lab on the fire. Make sure not to lose the hand item when walking in the room, if at any point you lose it you'll need to get it back from the Medicine Cabinet.\\n- You have 1:30 to complete the game and walk inside the cyber door to safely escape from the lab.",
  "23april08.title": "Bunny Eco World",
  "23aug01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_foodkioskaug.png",
  "23aug01.text": "Snack Attack:\\n\\nJoin one of Brooklyn's food kiosks: Veggie Vibes or BBQ Bites. Your goal will be to help your team be the first one to reach *80 points* before the time ends.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Be aware of the food that will come from the sky and click on your team's food plate to win a point.\\n\\n   * Red Team - BBQ Bites:*\\n       1) Fast Food  (nyc_c23_fastfood) --> +1 point\\n      2) All-American Breakfast (nyc_c23_breakfast) --> +1 point\\n\\n   * Green Team - Veggie Vibes:*\\n      1) Superfood Salad (nyc_c23_salad)  --> +1 point\\n      2) Brussels sprouts -->1 point\\n\\n- We've added some additional food items that will either help you win more points or lose a few if you click on them by mistake.\\n\\n  - Assorted Doughnuts (nyc_c23_donuts)  --> +5 points\\n  - Christmas Veggies (orange and yellow veggies) (xmas_c16_food2) --> -1 point\\n\\n- After the time has ended, players from the winning team will face off against each other to win an Aquamarine Baby Penguin by being the first one to click on Nighttime Shopper bag.",
  "23aug01.title": "NYC Dreams",
  "23aug02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_pianogame23.png",
  "23aug02.text": "The Hablliard School\\n\\nStep into the shoes of a talented pianist auditioning for a spot at the renowned Hablliard School of Music. Showcase your musical proficiency and make it through the three levels to earn your acceptance to the school.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Watch the pianist perform and try to remember all the keys he played and their order.\\n- After he's done it'll be your turn to play the song by pressing the correct piano keys. You'll have 60 seconds to complete it.\\n- When you're done, take the teleport to the next room.\\n- Once you've completed a level you can continue where you left off just make sure to be wearing the badge to be teleported to the queue.",
  "23aug02.title": "NYC Dreams",
  "23aug03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_metroa23.png",
  "23aug03.text": "Metro Madness: Habbo NYC Edition\\n\\nThe Habbo Fifth Avenue subway station is open to receive all Habbos. This subway station has been witness to many people coming and going, friendships ending while others are reunited. In each new trip this cycle seems to repeat and new stories are told.\\n\\nHurry up Habbos! Every 10 minutes the subway leaves the station and you don't want to miss the next train, do you?",
  "23aug03.title": "NYC Dreams",
  "23aug04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_metrogamb23.png|",
  "23aug04.text": "Metro Madness: Habbo NYC Edition\\n\\nHelp the MTA agent Jenny deal with the angry passengers. Talk to them and see if you can calm them down.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Type * to communicate with the passengers.\\n- Pay attention to the instructions they will give you to know what to do next.\\n- The passengers you'll need to interact with have an angry emoji.\\n- For certain passengers you may need to talk to them more than once. (By typing *)\\n- To complete the game you'll need to help the 5 angry passengers before the time ends.\\n\\nGood luck and enjoy the trip!",
  "23aug04.title": "NYC Dreams",
  "23earth00.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_pollutionocean.png",
  "23earth00.text": "Plastic waste found in the ocean has become one of the main environmental challenges our planet faces. Most plastics are not biodegradable which means they can be found in the environment for hundreds of years.\\n\\n This is why our team of scientists are taking matters into their own hands and diving to the bottom of the ocean to remove all the trash found there. Help them in their efforts to remove all the plastic waste from our oceans.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - Start off by waving your hand (say *o/*) to dive to the bottom of the ocean and collect the first piece of trash. You'll need to go around and collect the trash in order.\\n- Step on the trash and make a  thumbs up (say *_b*) to get back to the surface and take the trash to the ringplate. Make sure to be on top of the trash when making the thumbs up otherwise it won't work.\\n- When floating next to the ringplate, click on the next piece of trash and wave (say *o/*) only when you're floating over the trash you want to collect.\\n- You have 1:45 to remove the 5 pieces of trash and collect the prizes.\\n- If you get stuck say *_b* to return to the surface\\n\\n [https://i.ibb.co/DRGHrQ0/earth.gif|*] [https://i.ibb.co/DRGHrQ0/earth.gif| Check out] this gif on how to play.",
  "23earth00.title": "Earth Hour 2023 - Ocean Cleanup",
  "23earth000.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_hqearthhour23.png",
  "23earth000.text": "Our scientists are back taking on a new mission! Grab your oxygen and mask and get ready to dive with them to the bottom of the ocean where you'll get to see first hand how human pollution has negatively affected the marine ecosystems.\\n\\n  Each day a new game will open where you'll get the chance to win brand new badges and an exclusive Turquoise Candle!\\n\\n  These are the dates when the games will open:\\n\\n  * Game 1 - 25.03 (*:tele1*)\\n * Game 2 - 27.03 (*:tele2*)\\n * Game 3 - 29.03 (*:tele3*)\\n * Game 4 - 31.03 (*:tele4*)",
  "23earth000.title": "Earth Hour 2023!",
  "23earth01.1.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_coralnursery23.png",
  "23earth01.1.text": "Among the many things that affect coral reefs, the crown-of-thorns starfish which is a coral-eating starfish, has become a major cause of coral reef destruction. Touch them and you'll be painfully sorry for a long time.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n  - You have less than a minute to save the corals from the starfish. To do so, you must click on the \"smelly cheese\" furni to teleport to where the coral is and earn a point.\\n- Once you've rescued 5 corals you'll need to wave your hand (say *o/*) to win the game.\\n- Watch out for the starfish! If it touches you, you'll lose the game.",
  "23earth01.1.title": "Earth Hour 2023 - Crown of Thorns Starfish",
  "23earth01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_coralnursery23.png",
  "23earth01.text": "Even though they have survived for thousands of years, as time goes on there's less and less corals.This happens because of ocean acidification, local pollution, and above all, global warming.\\n\\n  To try to save the coral reefs, some scientists and associations have decided to restore the reefs by transplanting corals from one place to another or by cultivating them on site thanks to the Coral Nurseries.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - You have less than a minute to place all the coral cuttings on the rocks.\\n - Watch out for the jellyfishes that are out to play and want to prevent you from completing your work.\\n- To help save the corals you will need to stand in front of them and wave \"o/\" when the coral is on the rock. You have to do this 5 times before the time ends.\\n- Once the 5 corals are on their rock, wave one last time to complete the game and win the prize.",
  "23earth01.title": "Earth Hour 2023 - Coral Nursery",
  "23earth02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_plasticeh23.png",
  "23earth02.text": "Help the factory employees sort through the huge waste loads that have been collected. Their objective is to sort through the rubbish to obtain a higher quality of recycling with less impurities.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - Pick up the items that are *not* made of plastic by stepping on them.\\n- A green button will appear after you've found all the items, press it to continue to the next room.\\n- You have 1:30 to complete the game.",
  "23earth02.title": "Earth Hour 2023 - Factory - The final sorting",
  "23earth03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_factory2eh.png",
  "23earth03.text": "Now that the trash has been sorted, it's time to start the recycling process in which you'll need to organize the items made of the same material, break them down, and reuse them in a different way.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - Watch the items come out of the conveyor belt and try to guess the color group they will go to by stepping on the color tiles.\\n - Make sure to wait for the item to be on the white tile before stepping on the color tiles.\\n- Here's a clue to start you off: 6 recycled juice cartons will create a teddy bear.",
  "23earth03.title": "Earth Hour 2023 - Factory - Recycling Process",
  "23earth04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_underseamission.png",
  "23earth04.text": "Join the team's efforts on going underwater to help raise awareness on how marine life has been affected by the contamination of our oceans.\\n\\n They're bringing special tools needed to help them collect data and remove the waste accumulated on the ocean floor and it's causing a negative impact on marine ecosystem.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - Type *:down* to dive underwater.\\n- Walk carefully over the path created by the undersea rocks. Be careful not to fall off them, or you'll be teleported back to the start.\\n- Step on the *bubble seats* you'll find along the way to get some needed oxygen from them. Once the nearest tile has turned green, it'll mean that you can continue crossing through the path made by the undersea rocks.\\n- To reach the bubble seats that are high above type *:up*. After the tile has turned green, you can step on it to continue.\\n- When you've reached the end of the path, press the green button to be teleported back to mecha machine and say: *up*\\n- Step on the arrow tile and use the runestone teleport to continue to the next room.",
  "23earth04.title": "Earth Hour 2023 - Sea Life - The rescue",
  "23earth05.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_turtlegame.png",
  "23earth05.text": "Items like fishing gear, or discarded nets can cause damage to habitats like coral reefs or even trap and kill marine animals. In this game you will need to help rescue the turtle that's been trapped by the net and remove the marine debris you see lying around on the floor.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - You'll start off the game in a battle mech machine that helps you dive to the bottom of the ocean. Type *:down* to start.\\n- Walk carefully down the rocks and pick up the 3 pieces of trash you'll find.\\n- Stand in front of the sword and use it to cut the nets that have trapped the turtle.\\n- With the sword effect on, stand on the mossy rock and type * to cut the net. The effect will disappear after cutting the net.\\n- To get the effect back, stand on the bubble seat in front of the arrow plate and type *:up* to be teleported to the top of the rocks.\\n- After you've helped free the turtle, you'll then need to help clean up the 5 pieces of trash you'll find lying around the floor.\\n- When you're done a green button will appear in the game. Press it to collect the prizes.\\n\\n *Note*: if you lose your turtle effect needed to pick up the last pieces of trash, you'll need to find the *sea turtle*  furnis and  walk on them and get the effect back on otherwise you won't be able to collect the trash.",
  "23earth05.title": "Earth Hour 2023  - Sea Life - The rescue",
  "23easter01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_easter23.png",
  "23easter01.text": "Catch the 9 flying badges that are moving around the room and get some additional prizes while you're at it!Some badges will also include 10 free diamonds for the first 50 Habbos that manage to catch them!\\n\\nMake sure to first find the Easter Egg effect in order to get the diamonds *-*\\n\\nGet ready, set, go!\\n\\n Please note that if you've already reached you're ducket limit the new duckets you win in the game won't be added to the total so make sure to spend them regularly!",
  "23easter01.title": "Flying Badges - Easter Edition!",
  "23fast00.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_fastcooperation23.png",
  "23fast00.text": "Are you a team player? Well here's your opportunity to prove it! Grab 4 friends and get in line to put your game abilities to the test. If your team ends up in the top spot of the leaderboard at the end of the event, each of you will receive a Sack of Coins! Good luck!\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n  - Each team of 5 players need to work together to complete 5 rounds. 4 players will be outside controlling the pillows.\\n- The first pillow controls the gate by saying \"+\" or \"-\"\\n- Here's a summary of how each round will work:\\n\\n- *Round 1:* Get the player to the ORANGE tile using your pillows as guides. (Outside users move on their platforms to move their pillows in the middle and the middle player can only walk on the pillows)\\n\\n - *Round 2:* Get the player to the BLACK pillow, using your pillows as stackable guides. (Outside users move their pillows the same way as round one, by stacking their pillows to make stairs for the middle player to climb up onto the black pillow)\\n\\n - *Round 3:* Turn all tiles PINK walk on GREEN you lose, and other players move pillows to assist. (Outside players move their pillows the same way as rounds 1 and 2, moving their pillows for the middle player to walk on, turning all tiles pink when sat on a pillow that is on top of the tiles)\\n\\n - *Round 4:* PINK guides all pillows, don't go on GREEN, users block the pillows to stop the pillow from stepping on GREEN. Get pillows to ORANGE tile. (The roles are reversed this round, The center player will need to communicate where they will guide pillows. Outside players must block their pillow from going onto the GREEN tiles and guide all pillows to the ORANGE tiles, once your pillow is on the orange tile block it from moving again as all pillows must be on the orange tiles at the same time to win)\\n\\n  - *Round 5:* Watch the tiles in the middle then copy the pattern by stepping on the tiles. (Basically, copy the pattern in the middle as fast as you can) (Red Zone controls 1st tile. - Blue Zone controls 2nd tile. - Yellow Zone controls 3rd tile. - White Zone controls 4th tile. - Pink Zone controls 5th tile.)\\n\\n [https://twitter.com/MadsInnitt/status/1638904564601479168?s,20 ] [[https://twitter.com/MadsInnitt/status/1638904564601479168?s,20] Check out this link on how to play.",
  "23fast00.title": "Fast Cooperation!",
  "23feb01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_gamefeb23.png",
  "23feb01.text": "Piccolo has found himself in a pickle! He downloaded a file attached to an email he received. He later remembered what Frank always told him: \"Do not open emails from untrusted sources!\"\\n\\nIt's been a couple of days since this happened and he has started to notice his computer acting up. To help him, you will need to get inside Piccolo's computer and help him recover the personal information that was stolen from him. When you've recovered his personal information, you will then need to make sure his computer is safe from any future threats by installing two important security tools:\\n\\n   1) An **antivirus program** that will help detect, block and remove any malware from the system.\\n   2) A **firewall**, that will help protect his computer or network from unauthorized access and hacking attempts.\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - Walk up to Piccolo and sit on the stool to listen to what he has to tell you.\\n- Help him recover his personal information by stepping on the tiles until they've turned green.\\n- Watch out for the floating angels that are moving around, they're viruses designed to exploit Piccolo's computer.\\n- Once you've helped Piccolo recover all of his sensitive information, you'll need to pull the levers that will appear in the room to install the security tools that will keep his computer from any future attacks.\\n- You have 1:30 to help Piccolo. If you finish on time you'll win an exclusive badge AND a 2023 SID plushie.",
  "23feb01.title": "SID 2023 - Together for a better internet",
  "23feb02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_febgame2.png",
  "23feb02.text": "Protect the Habbo galaxy from the underway invasion of thousands of RoboCat plushies that threaten to put the safety of the galaxy at risk. Do you have the skills needed to keep the invaders at bay?\\n\\n How to play:\\n\\n - Step on the arrow plates to move the plane sideways.\\n- Once you've placed it in the correct position, use the lever to shoot the RoboCat plushies or stop the shot coming towards you.\\n- If you let the  RoboCat plushies reach the green cables, you'll lose a life.\\n- Some cats will manage to get away from the shot by moving at the right moment, when this happens you'll have to quickly shoot at it again.\\n- At the end of the event the top 5 Habbos that manage to survive the longest will win an additional badge. Good luck!",
  "23feb02.title": "Habbo Space Invaders",
  "23hween01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_hwenn23egypt1.png",
  "23hween01.text": "Patrick Jones, a well-known explorer, had the chance to spend a couple of days in the big pyramid of Habbiza and explore it. Although he is an experienced explorer, something happened and he was never the same. Concerned about him, the Egyptian Archeology Research Group asked Santini to enter the pyramid and find out what happened there. After entering Habbiza, Santini was never seen again.\\n\\nPatrick discovered a hidden secret room while exploring the pyramid. He was happy to find many treasures and all he could learn about them. But suddenly, something changed… His presence has woken something that was asleep for centuries… OMG is Seth and he wants his throne back! All pixel life is in danger! Seth has taken Santini prisoner to use his body as a vessel and come back as the rightful evil pharaon. Well, at least until he can gain enough energy and perform the ritual to return to life and rule Habbo!\\n\\nHabbos, it's time for you to help Santini! Destroy Seth's source of power, find all Osiris's jars and wake up Isis. She can bring Osiris back to life to fight Seth and take him back to the afterlife. This is the onyl way to save Santini and keep Habbo safe!\\n\\nStart you adventure and enter the Habbiza Pyramid, at your own risk!",
  "23hween01.title": "Tombs of Egypt",
  "23hween02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_hwenn23egypt2.png",
  "23hween02.text": "You have found the old throne room and something is not right. The pyramid's guardian is using the power of pyramids to charge Habbiza for Seth's reborn ritual. The only way to continue your search for Santini is to build a new pyramid and earn the guardian's right of passage.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- You'll need to go through all levels of the pyramid.\\n- In every level the goal is to get all color tiles orange. Plan the path you'll follow otherwise you will get a different color and will loose time.\\n- In some levels, you'll have fire moving trough the game field. If you step on the fire or it touches you, you'll be teleported back to the line.\\n- The spheres are there only to make your way more difficult.\\n- The beggining and the end of each level is the ring plate. Make your path in a way to get close to the ring plate and finish the game.",
  "23hween02.title": "Tombs of Egypt - Habbiza Pyramid",
  "23hween03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_hwenn23egypt3.png",
  "23hween03.text": "You have found the old throne room and something is not right. The pyramid's guardian is using the power of pyramids to charge Habbiza for Seth's reborn ritual. The only way to continue your search for Santini is to build a new pyramid and earn the guardian's right of passage.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- You'll need to go through all levels of the pyramid.\\n- In every level the goal is to get all color tiles orange. Plan the path you'll follow otherwise you will get a different color and will loose time.\\n- In some levels, you'll have fire moving trough the game field. If you step on the fire or it touches you, you'll be teleported back to the line.\\n- The spheres are there only to make your way more difficult.\\n- The beggining and the end of each level is the ring plate. Make your path in a way to get close to the ring plate and finish the game.",
  "23hween03.title": "Tombs of Egypt - Habbiza Pyramid",
  "23jan01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_cny23game.png",
  "23jan01.text": "The Chinese lunar calendar dictates that this year is the year of the RABBIT! Help light up the red candles to complete the ritual that will help you attract good luck and prosperity for this new year.How to play:- You will have one and a half minutes to light the 7 red candles that are on the outskirts of the temple.- You'll need to stand next to them and type \"*\".- Watch out for the dragonflies! If they touch you, you'll be teleported back.- If you manage to complete the game before the time ends, you'll win the badge and a Ruby Baby Penguin.",
  "23jan01.title": "Happy Chinese New Year 2023!",
  "23jan02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_chinesenewyear23.png",
  "23jan02.text": "Put your knowledge of the Chinese New Year to the test with a quiz we've published  inside the temple.\\n\\n In order to access the temple you will first need to find the hidden lever that will give you the badge you'll need to wear to take the teleport.\\n\\n Once you've got the badge, stand on the Chinese lantern and take the teleport to the inside of the temple.\\n\\nEveryone who answers *all* the questions in the poll correctly will receive an exclusive badge!",
  "23jan02.title": "Chinese New Year Quiz!",
  "23june01.body": "Shape Quest: Geometry Challenge\\n\\nTime to sharpen your knowledge of lines and angles! Your objective in this game is to survive inside the square without being hit by the colored cables. The game consists of 4 different levels that last for different amounts of time:\\n\\n*Level D*: 45 seconds\\n*Level C*: 35 seconds\\n*Level B*: 20 ​​seconds\\n*Level A*: 10 seconds\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Move inside the square while avoiding getting too close to the cables.\\n- Everyone who makes it to level B will get a badge and will earn their team a point.\\n- Whoever reaches level A will also score a point on the leaderboard for the chance to win a Top 5 badge.\\n\\n*Note*: The badge will be donated to you after you lose.",
  "23june01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_geometrygame.png",
  "23june01.text": "Shape Quest: Geometry Challenge\\n\\nTime to sharpen your knowledge of lines and angles! Your objective in this game is to survive inside the square without being hit by the colored cables. The game consists of 4 different levels that last for different amounts of time:\\n\\n*Level D*: 45 seconds\\n*Level C*: 35 seconds\\n*Level B*: 20 ​​seconds\\n*Level A*: 10 seconds\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Move inside the square while avoiding getting too close to the cables.\\n- Everyone who makes it to level B will get a badge and will earn their team a point.\\n- Whoever reaches level A will also score a point on the leaderboard for the chance to win a Top 5 badge.\\n\\n*Note*: The badge will be donated to you after you lose.",
  "23june01.title": "The Club Clash!",
  "23june02.body": "Color Mystery\\n\\nThe Fine Art class has put together a game that only those with true artistic instincts will be able to pass.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Watch the color block that will appear behind the glass doors.\\n- Try to guess the correct color by standing on top of one of the color blocks on the floor.\\n- You'll need to move fast, you'll only have *12 seconds* to stand on the color block you think matches the one behind the glass doors.\\n- Everyone who guesses correctly will move on to the next round. You'll need to guess the correct color *4 times* in order to win the game.",
  "23june02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_colormystery.png",
  "23june02.text": "Color Mystery\\n\\nThe Fine Art class has put together a game that only those with true artistic instincts will be able to pass.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Watch the color block that will appear behind the glass doors.\\n- Try to guess the correct color by standing on top of one of the color blocks on the floor.\\n- You'll need to move fast, you'll only have *12 seconds* to stand on the color block you think matches the one behind the glass doors.\\n- Everyone who guesses correctly will move on to the next round. You'll need to guess the correct color *4 times* in order to win the game.",
  "23june02.title": "The Club Clash!",
  "23june03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_physicsgame.png",
  "23june03.text": "Physics Lab:\\n\\nGet ready to put your energy in motion and help your team accumulate the most points in this week's game.\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Up to 10 people can be teleported into the game at the same time.\\n- The goal is to be the first one to reach the *green tile*  to help your team win a point.\\n- The tiles can turn yellow at any time, this means the entire row will disappear. You'll only have a few seconds to step off of them or you'll be eliminated.\\n- Watch out for the tiny doll walking around the game area, if it catches you you'll lose.\\n- You have 2 minutes to reach the green tile to help your team win a point and earn yourself a point for the chance to win a TOP5 badge",
  "23june03.title": "The Club Clash!",
  "23june04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_geometrygame.png",
  "23june04.text": "Speed Rivals:\\n\\nLace up your sneakers and get ready to unleash your inner athlete in this week's game! This is a multiplayer game, meaning that up to 4 people can play at the same time but only 1 will come out victorious!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Start off by guiding the soccer balls to the tiles.\\n- Jump over the Habbo-lympic hurdles placed along the racetrack.\\n- Finish off by guiding the tiny dolls to the finish line using the the arrow tiles.\\n\\nReady, Get Set, Go!",
  "23june04.title": "The Club Clash!",
  "23juneb1.body": "University Hallway\\n\\nCongrats on reaching the bonus game! You're free to roam around the hidden corners of the campus where there's said to be hidden prizes including diamonds for the fastest Habbos!\\n\\nIn order to find these prizes you'll need to interact with the furnis placed around the room. Some furnis may contain prizes while others may give you clues about actions you'll need to perform to gain access to a challenge room.\\n\\nThe challenge room contains different objectives to be completed.The first 10 Habbos to complete them will win *20 diamonds*. The challenge room will deactivate after 10 Habbos have successfully completed all of the challenges.\\n\\n",
  "23juneb1.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_geometrygame.png",
  "23juneb1.text": "University Hallway\\n\\nCongrats on reaching the bonus game! You're free to roam around the hidden corners of the campus where there's said to be hidden prizes including diamonds for the fastest Habbos!\\n\\nIn order to find these prizes you'll need to interact with the furnis placed around the room. Some furnis may contain prizes while others may give you clues about actions you'll need to perform to gain access to a challenge room.\\n\\nThe challenge room contains different objectives to be completed.The first 10 Habbos to complete them will win *20 diamonds*. The challenge room will deactivate after 10 Habbos have successfully completed all of the challenges.\\n\\n",
  "23juneb1.title": "The Club Clash!",
  "23lab01.body": "Wired Add-on: Movement Physics\\n\\nIt allows furnis to keep their altitude, move through other furniture or move through users.\\n\\nClick on the arrow plates to move the glowball and on the color tiles to enable each one of the wired options. If the color tile is green, it means that the option is enabled. If it is red, then the option is not enabled.\\n\\n*Arrow and lock icon*: Keep furni altitude\\n*Chair icon*: Move through furniture\\n*User icon*: Move through users",
  "23lab01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab01.text": "Wired Add-on: Movement Physics\\n\\nIt allows furnis to keep their altitude, move through other furniture or move through users.\\n\\nClick on the arrow plates to move the glowball and on the color tiles to enable each one of the wired options. If the color tile is green, it means that the option is enabled. If it is red, then the option is not enabled.\\n\\n*Arrow and lock icon*: Keep furni altitude\\n*Chair icon*: Move through furniture\\n*User icon*: Move through users",
  "23lab01.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23lab02.body": "WIRED Effect: Send Signal & WIRED Trigger: Receive Signal\\n\\nThey can to send and receive signals using the new Wired Antennas furni.\\n\\nClick on the rabbit button to see everything happening with no delay or on the turtle button to see each step at a time.\\n\\n- A Habbo clicks on one of the buttons to trigger one of the stacks.\\n- Stack 1 will send a signal to stack 2.\\n- Stack 2 will change the color of the tile and send a signal to stack 3.\\n- Stack 3 will rotate the arrow plate and send a signal to stack 4.\\n- Stack 4 will send a message to the Habbo who clicked the button.",
  "23lab02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab02.text": "WIRED Effect: Send Signal & WIRED Trigger: Receive Signal\\n\\nThey can to send and receive signals using the new Wired Antennas furni.\\n\\nClick on the rabbit button to see everything happening with no delay or on the turtle button to see each step at a time.\\n\\n- A Habbo clicks on one of the buttons to trigger one of the stacks.\\n- Stack 1 will send a signal to stack 2.\\n- Stack 2 will change the color of the tile and send a signal to stack 3.\\n- Stack 3 will rotate the arrow plate and send a signal to stack 4.\\n- Stack 4 will send a message to the Habbo who clicked the button.",
  "23lab02.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23lab03.body": "WIRED Trigger: User Clicks Furni\\n\\nIt is triggered when a user clicks on selected furni.\\n\\n- Click on the blue base light to turn it on/off.\\n- Click on the pink plasto chair to rotate it.\\n- Click on the color tile to change its color.\\n- Click on the pressure plate to show a message.",
  "23lab03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab03.text": "WIRED Trigger: User Clicks Furni\\n\\nIt is triggered when a user clicks on selected furni.\\n\\n- Click on the blue base light to turn it on/off.\\n- Click on the pink plasto chair to rotate it.\\n- Click on the color tile to change its color.\\n- Click on the pressure plate to show a message.",
  "23lab03.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23lab04.body": "WIRED Trigger: Furni State Is Changed\\n\\nIt is triggered when the selected furni changes its state, no matter if it is done by a user or not.\\n\\nHere we present two examples:\\n\\n1) Every 2 seconds the color and number tiles toggle their states to the next one. The new trigger detects this state change and toggles the other color and number tiles to their previous states;\\n\\n2) The trigger detects every time the hidden pyramid toggles its state (when it appears and disappears), and then toggles the color of the next color tile. Then, when its color is changed to yellow, the arrow plate is rotated.",
  "23lab04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab04.text": "WIRED Trigger: Furni State Is Changed\\n\\nIt is triggered when the selected furni changes its state, no matter if it is done by a user or not.\\n\\nHere we present two examples:\\n\\n1) Every 2 seconds the color and number tiles toggle their states to the next one. The new trigger detects this state change and toggles the other color and number tiles to their previous states;\\n\\n2) The trigger detects every time the hidden pyramid toggles its state (when it appears and disappears), and then toggles the color of the next color tile. Then, when its color is changed to yellow, the arrow plate is rotated.",
  "23lab04.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23lab05.body": "WIRED Add-on: Execution Limit\\n\\nIt limits the number of executions of a stack in a certain period of time.\\n\\nHere are two examples:\\n\\n1) Three identical stacks move one glowball each, but different they have execution limits: 2, 5 or 8 every 10 seconds.\\n\\n2) This wired also allows you to increase the default limit from 1 time to100. This can be seen in the example with the bots walking.",
  "23lab05.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab05.text": "WIRED Add-on: Execution Limit\\n\\nIt limits the number of executions of a stack in a certain period of time.\\n\\nHere are two examples:\\n\\n1) Three identical stacks move one glowball each, but different they have execution limits: 2, 5 or 8 every 10 seconds.\\n\\n2) This wired also allows you to increase the default limit from 1 time to100. This can be seen in the example with the bots walking.",
  "23lab05.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23lab06.body": "WIRED Effect: Set Furni Altitude & WIRED Condition: Furni Altitude Matches\\n\\nThe wired effect changes the selected furni altitude. The wired condition can check if the selected furni are in an lower, higher or has the exact altitude.\\n\\nClick on the green arrow to increase the furni altitude and on the red arrow to decrease it.",
  "23lab06.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab06.text": "WIRED Effect: Set Furni Altitude & WIRED Condition: Furni Altitude Matches\\n\\nThe wired effect changes the selected furni altitude. The wired condition can check if the selected furni are in an lower, higher or has the exact altitude.\\n\\nClick on the green arrow to increase the furni altitude and on the red arrow to decrease it.",
  "23lab06.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23lab07.body": "WIRED Add-on: Carry Users\\n\\nIt allows users to be carried by furnis.\\n\\nClick on the Arrow Tiles to move the Arrow Plate. To add or remove the new wired to the stacks, click on the Color Tile. Try carrying the bot using the Ringplate.",
  "23lab07.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab07.text": "WIRED Add-on: Carry Users\\n\\nIt allows users to be carried by furnis.\\n\\nClick on the Arrow Tiles to move the Arrow Plate. To add or remove the new wired to the stacks, click on the Color Tile. Try carrying the bot using the Ringplate.",
  "23lab07.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23lab08.body": "Wired Add-on: Cancel Move Animation\\n\\nIt cancels the move animation of the selected furni in the wireds of the respective stack.\\n\\nIn the examples, it cancels the movement of the glowball and the rotation of the arrowplate",
  "23lab08.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23lab08.text": "Wired Add-on: Cancel Move Animation\\n\\nIt cancels the move animation of the selected furni in the wireds of the respective stack.\\n\\nIn the examples, it cancels the movement of the glowball and the rotation of the arrowplate",
  "23lab08.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23labintro.body": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!\\n\\nWalk around the lab and check out some example of the new wireds can be used.\\n\\nStep on the ringplates to test how the different wireds can be used or just type: *:1*, *:2*, *:3*, *:6* or *:7*",
  "23labintro.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wiredlab.png",
  "23labintro.text": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!\\n\\nWalk around the lab and check out some example of the new wireds can be used.\\n\\nStep on the ringplates to test how the different wireds can be used or just type: *:1*, *:2*, *:3*, *:6* or *:7*",
  "23labintro.title": "Welcome to the Habbo Wired Lab!",
  "23march01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_habbotennis.png",
  "23march01.text": "Happy Women's Day!\\n\\nMarch 8th, marks International Women's Day, a day dedicated to celebrating women's achievements, recognizing the challenges they face and continuing to seek gender equality for a better tomorrow.\\n\\nThere's so many great women out there and we wanted to celebrate a few of them specifically by creating a game inspired by their accomplishments.\\n\\nFirst up is a Grand Slam champion who has poured her heart and soul into her sport, and has pushed her boundaries to the limit. Are you down for a friendly match with Serena Williams?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- The match will last for 45 seconds.\\n- You have 2 seconds to reach the ball and throw it back at her by stepping on the arrow tile.\\n- Don't let the tiles turn red or you'll lose. Good luck!",
  "23march01.title": "Happy Women's Day!",
  "23march02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_mariecurielab.png",
  "23march02.text": "Happy Women's Day!\\n\\nMarie Curie is a symbol of the achievements of women in science. Even though she had to face discrimination because of her gender, her work paved the way for future generations of women in science.\\n\\n She was the first woman to win a Nobel Prize, and the first person ever to win two Nobel Prizes in different fields. Even to this day she's still an inspiration for women around the world to follow their passions and make their mark on the world.\\n\\nTravel back in time and help Marie Curie complete the new experiment she's working on. Do you think you know enough about science to be her new lab partner?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Marie Curie will ask you to find the items she needs for her experiment by asking you a series of science questions.\\n- Once you know the answer and have found the item in the room, you'll need to walk towards it and stand near it until she gives you the next set of instructions.\\n- You have 1:30 minute to help her find all the items she needs for her experiment. Good luck!",
  "23march02.title": "Happy Women's Day!",
  "23march03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_HabboZZle.png",
  "23march03.text": "We bring you a new puzzle game where you'll need to program a robot to follow the instructions you give him. The goal is to make the robot collect all the coins in order to complete each level.\\n\\n There are 3 possible actions for the bot to do:\\n\\n - Go forward\\n- Rotate to the right\\n- Rotate to the left\\n\\n By clicking the boxes you can select the action and the color to form the instructions. The colors you can select are:\\n\\n - White (any color)\\n- Red\\n- Blue\\n- Green\\n\\n *Examples*\\n\\n :RED + RIGHT ARROW ---> If the robot is on a red tile, it will rotate to the right.\\nWHITE + FORWARD ARROW ---> On any color, go forward.\\n\\n When you've set up the order you want the robot to move, click on the boxes on Module 1 or 2 to place the instructions there.\\n\\n The robot will follow the instructions in order, starting from the line 1.\\nYou can repeat the cycle of instructions by putting the block number \"1\" \\nYou can execute the instructions on Module 2 by putting the block number \"2\" \\n\\n *Examples*:\\n\\n RED + 2 ---> If the robot is on a red tile, execute the instructions in Module 2.\\nWHITE + 1 ---> On any color, restart the cycle from the first instruction.\\n\\n Make sure to be wearing the badge from the previous level before stepping on the arrow tile in order to continue.\\n\\nYou can get a free tutorial on the robozzle's website, from which this game is inspired by. It may be a bit challenging at first but when you start solving the puzzles you won't want to stop!\\n\\n [https://i.imgur.com/yS4ETCB.gif|*] [https://i.imgur.com/yS4ETCB.gif| Check out] this gif on how to play.",
  "23march03.title": "HabboZZle",
  "23may01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_seamonster.png",
  "23may01.text": "Race against the strange creatures that live in the deepest parts of the ocean and win some exclusive badges while you're at it!How to play: - Race towards the green tiles and step on them to win points.- Every time you pull one of the levers you will let one of the sea monsters out which will make the game harder since they will come after you, but at the same time you'll get more points for each time that you step on the green tile.    0 animals in the field: 1 point per green tile    1 animal in the field: 2 points per green tile    2 animals in the field: 3 points per green tile    3 animals in the field: 5 points per green tile    4(all) animals in the field: 8 points per green tile- For every sea monster that you dare to release into the game; you'll get an extra 3 points. Releasing all 4 will get you 12 points.Prizes:- If you manage to get 150 points you'll get a Sea Monster Hunter badge.- But if you manage to get 250 points you'll win a Sea Monster Champion badge and a Jasper Baby Penguin.Good luck!",
  "23may01.title": "Sea Beasts!",
  "24RubberDuck1.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_Rubber_Ducky_GameII.png",
  "24RubberDuck1.text": "Who doesn't like rubber duckies? We all do, especially in Habbo. There are so many different type of duckies in Habbo. Let's put them in the spot light!In every room you will find a painting with a lot of ducks. Each painting shows 1 duck that does not belong in the painting. Find this duck and click on it. You have 15 seconds to find it.When you have found the duck, you automatically proceed to the next game. There are 3 levels. After 3 levels you win an exclusive badge!",
  "24RubberDuck1.title": "24RubberDuck1.title",
  "24chess1.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_chessgame.png",
  "24chess1.text": "Where strategy meets virtual fun! Challenge your friends while sharpening your chess skills. Move your pieces strategically in order to eat your opponent's King within the 10 min timeframe.Outsmart your opponents for a chance to win an exclusive badge!",
  "24chess1.title": "Habbo's Chess Game",
  "24circus01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24circus01.png",
  "24circus01.text": "Magicians Mayhem!\\n\\nSo, you're trying to earn your spot as one of the circus crew? You're in luck! They're just starting their tour in Habbo and need some help getting everything ready for their big opening.\\nTo join them, you'll first need to prove you are circus material by completing a series of tasks they have in store.\\nYour first task will be to help Silvan the magician gather all the tools he needs for his show. Are you up for the task?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n- Listen to what Silvan has to tell you and answer **yes** if you are willing to help him out.\\n- Read carefully all the items he needs you to get for him and start walking around the game area to collect them by saying **picks** when standing next to them.\\n- Watch out for the Bouncers that will appear, they don't know you are helping Silvan and will kick anyone they consider to be intruders.\\n- When you've collected all the items, go back to the fence entrance and say **done!** to collect your prizes.",
  "24circus01.title": "Cirque Du Pixels!",
  "24circus02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24circus02.png",
  "24circus02.text": "One-Wheel Circus Challenge\\n\\nThe Master Unicyclist isn't entirely convinced of your skills and has challenged you to a unicycle race across the circus arena. It's time to put your balance to the test!\\nHow to play:\\n- The first person in the queue will be teleported inside the circus, where the Master Unicyclist is waiting.\\n- Use the red blocks in the middle of the arena to guide your unicycle.\\n- You need to collect all 3 red balls before reaching the end of the path.\\n- Watch out for any obstacles along the way.\\n- Reach the Large Circus Platform before the Master Unicyclist to win the game. Good luck!",
  "24circus02.title": "Cirque Du Pixels!",
  "24circus03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24circus03.png",
  "24circus03.text": "Think you're smarter than a mouse? The circus mouse has set a memory challenge for anyone who dares to try it.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n- Keep an eye on the circus mouse and watch his every move to see the colors he set on the tiles. You better not blink, he moves fast!\\n- When he's done, set the tiles to the same colors he used. Once you're finished, pull the lever to submit your answer.\\n- If you guessed correctly, you'll move on to the next room.",
  "24circus03.title": "Circus Mouse Memory Challenge",
  "24circus04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24circus03.png",
  "24circus04.text": "Uh-oh! It seems you took the wrong teleport and have found yourself inside the clown's trailer. They're not too keen on having uninvited visitors, so you better get out of there ASAP!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n- One of the clown's has found you and as you expected he's not too happy.\\n- Run away from the him for a minute and do not let him catch you or you'll lose.\\n- If you manage to survive for an entire minute, you'll win the prizes. ",
  "24circus04.title": "Clown on the Loose!",
  "24circus05.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24circus04.png",
  "24circus05.text": "Your time has come to find out once and for all if your circus material or not. Prepare to defy gravity and prove you have what it takes to join the team.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n- Jump 3 times across the trapeze. Each time the trapeze will move faster so you need to stay laser-focused!\\n- If you fall off the trapeze 3 times, you'll be eliminated and you'll be teleported back to the queue.\\n- You have 1 minute to pass the trials. Good luck!",
  "24circus05.title": "Circus Stars: Trapeze Trials!",
  "24easter01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_witchcottage1.png",
  "24easter01.text": "Embark on this adventure with Petal, a young botanist on a mission to find long-forgotten existence of magical creatures. Petal has started to research on her own by asking the town's wise elder, Ned, to help her find the ingredients she needs for her quest.\\n\\nUnfortunately, Ned doesn't know where the ingredients can be found but has pointed towards someone who does: the enigmatic witch, Hecate.\\n\\nYour first task will be venture into the depths of the forest to find the witch's hidden cottage and get the help you need from her.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n - Walk towards Darius and see if he can help you meet the witch Hecate.\\n - Find all the roses in the room and step on them to collect them.\\n - When you're done, stand in front of the basket and say **create bouquet**\\n",
  "24easter01.title": "Fae Farmstead",
  "24easter02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_witchcottage2.png",
  "24easter02.text": "Well done! You've managed to gain access to Hecate's cottage! Now, it's time to complete your mission and get the location of the ingredients Petal needs for her quest.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n - There are a total of 3 crystals that can be found in the room.\\n - Stand on the tile in front of the crystals and click on them to put them in the safe.\\n - When you're done, stand in front of the witch so she can tell you what you need to do next.\\n",
  "24easter02.title": "Hecate's Cottage",
  "24easter03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_findingingredients1.png",
  "24easter03.text": "Collecting the right ingredients\\n\\nAfter helping Hecate and wondering through the forest, you finally found the right spot where the magic plants grow. To get the right plants for each magical creature, you will need to know the recipes, to be fast and get some help.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- With the help of another habbo, both of you will need to collect the right ingredients to create 3 enchanted creatures. Push the lever to know which is the element of the creatures you'll need to find the ingredients for.\\n- You can only collect the ingredients if both of you are using the right hand item.\\n- To pick the right hand item, the player on the left will need to go through the one way doors and pick the right seed using the lever. When you get to the seeds of your element, push the green button and get back.\\n- The player on the right can turn the one way doors by sitting or standing up.\\n- Give the hand item to your partner on the right and pick another one for you.\\n- When both of you have the right hand item, look for the ingredients. Step on them and say *** to collect it.\\n- Repeat this for 3 elements/animals to complete the game.\\n- When you collect all the ingredients necessary for 3 magical creatures, you and your partner will win the prize for your efforts.",
  "24easter03.title": "Dragonfly Farmstead",
  "24easter03a.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_findingned1.png",
  "24easter03a.text": "Finding Ned\\n\\nNow that you already have all the ingredients necessary to create the enchanted creatures, you need to find Ned to help you to build a device to mix all the ingredients. Finding Ned can be tricky since we loves to walk around. Petal and some villagers saw Ned going to the forest. Can you find him?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Enter the forest and find you way around. Use the arrow teleport.\\n- Find Ned to win the prize.",
  "24easter03a.title": "Dragonfly Farmstead",
  "24easter03b.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_findingned2.png",
  "24easter03b.text": "Finding Ned\\n\\nYou've found Ned's Farm! Now you need to cross the field to the other side.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\nThe course is divided in two parts:\\n\\nFirst part:\\n- Don't let the brown chickens get you. They are mad and will chase you back to the beginning.\\n- The white chickens just block your way.\\n\\nSecond part:\\n- Only walk when the dog is not looking in your direction, otherwise you are sent back to the middle of the course.\\n- The goal is to enter the arrow teleport in the Forest Path located on the right-hand side of the room.",
  "24easter03b.title": "Dragonfly Farmstead",
  "24easter05.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_game3easter24.png",
  "24easter05.text": "Creating Elemental Creatures\\n\\nAfter a long journey, we finnally have all that we need to create the enchanted creatures and restablish the energy balance in the world.\\nTo successfully create the elemental creatures, Petal needs build the \"Elemental Fusion Cauldron,\" a device capable of blending the ingredients and channeling the magical energies needed to bring the creatures to life. With Ned's guidance we can build the device to create all the animals found in the old book.\\n\\nThe game is divided in 2 parts:\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\nPart 1: Build the Elemental Fusion Cauldron (You'll have 1:20 to complete it)\\n\\n- Gather the 4 rocks and bring them towards the campfire.\\n- After that, you'll need to walk inside each cottage to find the Icky Ooze Jar needed to build the cauldron. Once you've found it bring it ot the campfire and say *.\\n\\nPart 2: Create the Elemental Creature (You'll have 1 minute to complete it)\\n\\n- You'll need to create the creature being summoned by the village based on the seeds that will appear in the game.  There are 2 possible options so make sure to look for the right ingredients.\\n- To gather the ingredients you'll need to walk towards them and bring them to cauldron.\\n- Ingredients for the *yellow seeds*: 1x Winged Harness (clothing_rainbowwings), 1x Fire Seeds (easter_c24_fireseed) and 1x Astro Bunny (celestial_c19_spacebun)\\n- Ingredients for the *blue seeds*: 1x Dragonfly Wings (clothing_r20_dragonflywings), 1x Water Seeds (easter_c24_waterseed) and 1x Astro Bunny (celestial_c19_spacebun)\\n- Once you've collected all the ingredients, stand in front of the cauldron and say * to bring the elemental creature to life.",
  "24easter05.title": "Dragonfly Farmstead",
  "24farm01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_farmcolorsapril.png",
  "24farm01.text": "Spring is here, and what better way to recharge your batteries than in the countryside, observing nature and the animals on the Farm?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- The aim of the game is to reproduce the 7 images (fruits, vegetables or animals) in the badges display.\\n- You have 2 mn 30 sec to reproduce each image.\\n- The level of difficulty increases from left to right.\\n\\n- To start, move forward in the queue (click on the green button if you have trouble clicking), then at the end of the queue (when you're the first player), click on the green button again to sit down, and you'll be teleported.\\n- You then have 10 seconds to choose the drawing of your choice by clicking on the corresponding badge display.\\n\\nTo draw :\\n- Click on the color of your choice on the palette (12 colors + 1 white to erase), then click on the squares you wish to color on your platform.\\n- Once you've finished your drawing, click on the flower wagon to validate it.\\n- If you've made a mistake, a message will appear and you'll be able to fix it if there's time left.\\n\\nPS : If you want to watch your friends play, say *look*\\n\\nGood luck!",
  "24farm01.title": "The Farm in Colors",
  "24freeze01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_freeze24.png",
  "24freeze01.text": "Gather your friends and prepare to enter an icy arena where every move counts. Are you ready to face the freeze and emerge as the ultimate champion?How to play:- Wait your turn in the roller row. When you reach the end and a new game is available, say a color to choose your team: \"red\", \"blue\", \"yellow\" or \"green\".- When the game starts, you must eliminate your opponents from the playing field by freezing them. Take every life they have! To throw a snowball you must double click on the freeze boxes.- The winning team will receive a prize and will be able to play again without needing to restart the room.- - For each round you play and win (up to a maximum of 3) you will win an exclusive badge. Freeze your opponents!Note: For a game to start there must be at least two teams with one player on each.",
  "24freeze01.title": "Freeze Battle!",
  "24june01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_junegame01.png",
  "24june01.text": "You've found the room where Donnie believes he saw the old rare last. Now it's time to see if you can help Donnie find it.How to play:- Walk around the room and type * near the different furnis to lift them and see if the rare is hidden underneath one of them.- You have 1:30 minute to find it, but don't worry: when you're close to the last place where Donnie saw the rare, you'll see a lightning bolt message indicating you're on the right track. Good luck!",
  "24june01.title": "Habbo History Exhibition",
  "24june02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_junegame02.png",
  "24june02.text": "Donnie's exhibition plans have grown more complex than he initially expected. He now needs help collecting the blueprint pieces for a time machine he's looking to build to go back in time and get the rare he's so desperetaly looking for.How to play:- Walk around the game area and step on the blueprint pieces. There's a total of 8 pieces you need to collect.- Watch out for the Frank statues and ghost, if they catch you you'll lose.- You have 2 minutes to complete the game. Good luck!",
  "24june02.title": "Habbo History Exhibition",
  "24june03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_junegame03.png",
  "24june03.text": "It's time to navigate the chaos of the maintenance room to chase and catch the elusive components Donnie needs to build the time machine.Items to catch:- 2 gears- 2 springs- 2 gauges- 2 leversh2. How to play:- Keep your focus on the game, every few seconds one of the listed pieces will appear in the room and your goal is to try to be the first person who catches them.- There's 4 new badges up for grabs if you manage to catch all the items. - Once you've collected the 4 badges, make sure to wear them to get access to access to a secret room where an additional prize has been placed.",
  "24june03.title": "Habbo History Exhibition",
  "24june04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_junegame04.png",
  "24june04.text": "You've got the Time Machine ready. Now, it's time to power it up by completing this quest!",
  "24june04.title": "Habbo History Exhibition",
  "24june05.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_junegame05.png",
  "24june05.text": "You've managed to make the time machine work and now you've made your way to the past. It's time to help Donnie find the rare he's needs for his exhibition.How to play:- Step 1: Stand on the tile next to Donnie and listen to what he has to tell you.- Step 2: Use the mannequin to hide behind it as you try to reach the switch next to the curtains. You can only move to 2 tiles at a time.- Step 3: Watch out for the red lights, if you are \"caught\" by one of them you'll be taken back to the start. - Step 4: Double-click on the switch and place the mannequin in front of the microphone.- Step 5: Go upstairs and switch on the lights (click on the dimmer while being next to it).- Step 6: Unblock the rare, by clicking on the tables and dividers, then click on it when it's in front of you.You have 3 minutes to complete the game. Good luck!",
  "24june05.title": "Habbo History Exhibition",
  "24june06.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_junegame06.png",
  "24june06.text": "Well done! You've found Maude's Studio! Now it's time to get the floppy disk Frank is in dire need of and bring it back to him but be careful Maude has installed cameras and sensors everywhere in the room so you'll need to be careful.How to play:- Walk around the studio quietly, if you walk too fast and make too much noise, you'll get caught. - Keep a slow and steady pace to avoid the noise detector from reaching the red tile.- You need to find the 2 pair of keys placed in the room to open the rope dividers. Once you've found them, type * to collect them.- The last thing left to do is collect the floppy disk behind the black piano and make your way back to the starting point to leave the studio.",
  "24june06.title": "Habbo History Exhibition",
  "24june07.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_junegame07.png",
  "24june07.text": "You got the floppy disk Frank needed; now it's time to find out what's stored inside. Your last task before diving into the mystery behind Frank's obsession with this disk is to get his old computer working again.How to play:- Walk around the game area and head towards the blue toolboxes Frank needs to fix his PC.- To move, simply click on the green ball above your head towards the direction you want to go, and then click on the red ball when you want to stop.- You must collect 5 toolboxes in total to fix the PC and win the game. Good luck!",
  "24june07.title": "Habbo History Exhibition",
  "24neon01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24neon01.png",
  "24neon01.text": "The night sky glows with neon hues, but something feels off. You’re not sure how you got here, but there's no time to think. You and your friends are being hunted. Can you escape the threats before it's too late?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- **Run away from the wolf** - If it catches you twice, you'll lose.\\n- **Grab a hammer** - Head to the toolbox and type * to pick up a hammer.\\n-** Break the yellow fence** - Go near the yellow fence and type ** to break it.\\n- **Avoid traps** - Cross over the fence and be careful of traps on the ground. Falling into them will cost you time.\\n- **Use the torch** - Find the torch, then click on it or type * to use it.\\n- **Race the wolf** - Now, it's time to beat the wolf in a race on the track!\\n-** Heal your wounds** -  First, go to the First Aid Kit. Click on it or type *grab* to heal the wounds you got while escaping.\\n-** Find the Silver Sword** - Locate the Silver Sword, click on it, or type *grab* to protect yourself from the werewolf.\\n-**Run to safety** - Once you're safe, run into the spotlight in the forest to win.\\n- You have 3 minutes to complete the game and outrun the werewolf. Good luck!",
  "24neon01.title": "Neon Nightmare!",
  "24neon02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24neon02.png",
  "24neon02.text": "Hexed Labyrinth\\n\\nStep into the forest and search for the witch’s lair. With each step, you venture deeper into the unknown. Be sure to keep track of where you’ve been—you don’t want to lose your way.\\nAlong the path, you’ll encounter mystic creatures who will help you uncover parts of a powerful spell. Write down each phrase they give you, and be sure to arrange them in the correct order for when the time comes to cast the spell.",
  "24neon02.title": "Neon Nightmare!",
  "24neon03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24neon03.png",
  "24neon03.text": "Graveyard Feast\\n\\nThree of your friends have been captured by crazed zombies and your mission now is to lure them back into the Vampire Coffin. Once you’ve freed your friends, make your way to the door that leads to the forest to secure your victory. Can you outsmart the crazed zombies and make it to safety? \\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Find the food that is the zombies' weakness.\\n- Approach the food and click on it to make the zombie follow you.\\n- Quickly lead the zombie towards the Vampire Coffin.\\n- After eliminating the zombie, go to the cage where your friend is trapped and click on the cage to rescue them.\\n- Once you've rescued all three friends, head to the door that leads to the forest to win the game!",
  "24neon03.title": "Neon Nightmare!",
  "24neon04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24neon04.png",
  "24neon04.text": "Prom Night Escape\\n\\nIt's Prom Night, and the whole crew is ready for an unforgettable evening. But Bonnie has something unexpected in store, and it might not be the night they were hoping for...\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Use the water pump to fill up your water cup and help rescue your friends.\\n- With your cup full, head over to any fire that’s blocking the bots or your way.\\n- Step on the fire to put it out. It'll disappear when you do. Tip: Only worry about the fires that are actually in the way.\\n- After using your water, go back to the pump to refill your cup.\\n- Once all your friends are free and the path is clear, make your way to the hallway exit..\\n- You've got 2 minutes to finish up, so act fast!",
  "24neon04.title": "Neon Nightmare!",
  "24neon05.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24neon05.png",
  "24neon05.text": "Basement: The Secret Hideout\\n\\nWelcome to The Secret Hideout! In this mysterious underground lair, you'll need to **activate the quest** before unleashing the spell. Will the spell put an end to all this once and for all?",
  "24neon05.title": "Neon Nightmare!{image|url,web_promo_small/spromo_24neon04.png|align,right|hspace,10|vspace,0}h1. Prom Night EscapeIt's Prom Night, and the whole crew is ready for an unforgettable evening. But Bonnie has something unexpected in store, and it might not be the night they were hoping for...h2. How to play:- Use the water pump to fill up your water cup and help rescue your friends.- With your cup full, head over to any fire that’s blocking the bots or your way.- Step on the fire to put it out. It'll disappear when you do. Tip: Only worry about the fires that are actually in the way.- After using your water, go back to the pump to refill your cup.- Once all your friends are free and the path is clear, make your way to the hallway exit.- You've got 2 minutes to finish up, so act fast!",
  "24stpatricksday.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_24stpatricksday.png",
  "24stpatricksday.text": "Helping Leprechaun\\n\\nThe Leprechaun is mad because some elves found his pot of gold and stole it. The elves found a way to protect their land against all leprechauns, so he needs some help to get his gold back. Can you do it?How to play:\\n\\n- - One at a time, you need to pick up 3 coins and bring them to the golden cauldron in the center.\\n- To collect and put the coins in the cauldron just say *** beside of it.\\n- Be careful, don't let any of the elves get near you or you'll need to start from the begginning.\\n- Every time you collect one of the coins, Charlie will chase you throughout the room, so you must be agile and move FAST!\\n- If you step in the mushrooms, you'll be frozen for 3 seconds.\\n- After collecting the 3 coins, get back to the start corner to win your prize.\\n- You have 60 seconds to complete the game.\\n\\nGood luck!",
  "24stpatricksday.title": "St Patrick's Day",
  "24winter01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_WinterinColors25.png",
  "24winter01.text": "Winter is here, and what better way to recharge your batteries than in a mountain chalet, with a hot chocolate in front of the fireplace?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- The aim of the game is to reproduce the 6 images (Christmas symbols) in the badges display.\\n- Take the teleporter corresponding to the badge you want to draw.\\n- When you're in the room, to start, move forward in the queue, then at the end of the queue (when you're the first player), click in front of you to sit down, and you'll be teleported.\\n- Your mission begins: you have 2 min 30 sec to reproduce the image!\\n\\nTo draw :\\n- Click on the color of your choice on the palette (12 colors + 1 white to erase), then click on the squares you wish to color on your platform.\\n- Once you've finished your drawing, click on the Finnish Forest Reindeer furni to validate it.\\n- If you've made a mistake, a message will appear and you'll be able to fix it if there's time left.\\n- When you won all the 6 badges, return to the Hall and sit on a chair in front of the Chocolate stand to get the bonus badge. If you've missed any badges, a message will tell you which ones are missing.\\n\\nPS : If you want to watch your friends play, say *look*\\n\\nGood luck!",
  "24winter01.title": "Winter in Colors",
  "24xmas01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_xmas24games.png",
  "24xmas01.text": "Gloria's Christmas Rescue!\\n\\nWell done! You’re halfway through the maze! Next, you’ll need to find the levers that will light up the glowing balls. Once all the balls are glowing, step on the tiles at the end of the street to activate the teleport and move on to the next room.\\n\\nGood luck!",
  "24xmas01.title": "Twelve Tasks of Xmas!",
  "24xmas01B.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_xmas24games.png",
  "24xmas01B.text": "Gloria's Christmas Rescue!\\n\\nYou’ve made it to the room where the evil elf is holding Gloria. To free her, you’ll need to defeat him in a battle!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Step on the purple tile to activate a power-up effect.\\n- Avoid all the attacks ElfoBomb is throwing your way.\\n- Make your way to the end of the street and stand in front of ElfoBomb to weaken him until he loses all his life points.\\n\\nGood luck!",
  "24xmas01B.title": "Twelve Tasks of Xmas!",
  "24xmas02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_xmas24games.png",
  "24xmas02.text": "Help save neighbor Phil!\\n\\nPhil was garderning while all of a sudden a fierce snowstorm has buried him under a thick blanket of snow. Unfortunately, we haven’t been able to gather any information that could lead us directly to him. However, we managed to locate a phone that can receive his signal by following the arrows. Can you save our good neighbor Phil?\\n\\n  How to play:\\n\\n- Follow the arrows to locate the phone\\n- Check each numbered locations to see if you can get Phil's signal.\\n- When you've found a signal, report the number to the location where you find the signal and help us rescue Phil.\\n- You have 1:30 minutes to complete the game and save Phil. Get your gloves ready and start searching for Phil!",
  "24xmas02.title": "Twelve Tasks of Xmas!",
  "24xmas03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_xmas24games.png",
  "24xmas03.text": "It's time to help Timothy cook Xmas Dinner!\\n\\nReady for some Habbo Xmas Crush? Tie on your apron, preheat the oven and let the festive culinary adventure begin. Will you be able to find the correct ingredients for Timothy's Xmas dinner?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Combine 3 or more ingredients for the recipe by clicking on the item you want to move and click again where you want to change it.\\n- Trees can be destroyed ONLY by combining them with other furni (they can only be destroyed if you use e.g. 3 flours + 1 tree)\\n\\nPoints:\\n\\nthree of a kind -> 3 points\\nfour of a kind -> 6 points\\nfive of kind -> 9 points\\nbroken tree -> 5 extra points\\nYou need to win 110 points to complete the game.\\n\\n- You have 1:30 minutes to complete the game and save Christmas dinner. Good luck!",
  "24xmas03.title": "Twelve Tasks of Xmas!",
  "24xmas04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_xmas24games.png",
  "24xmas04.text": "Shopping for the perfect gifts\\n\\nIt's already Xmas and Timothy hasn't got any presents yet. Can you help him this last minute to rush to the store and get him the ultimate perfect gift?\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n-  Step 1: First you need to get some money. Collect 20 credits in the Shop.\\n- Step 2: You need to control the robot and defeat the opponents who are throwing stones. Using the < and > buttons to move and the middle button to attack. When you defeat your opponents, you will receive the badge. Good luck!",
  "24xmas04.title": "Twelve Tasks of Xmas!",
  "24xmas04B.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_spromo_xmas24games.png",
  "24xmas04B.text": "Holiday Prep Party!\\n\\nHelp Timothy and Gloria set up for a very special Christmas!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- At the start of the game, click on the block above either Timothy’s or Gloria’s head to choose who you want to help.\\n- Once you’ve chosen your character, click in front of the travel trunk and then on it to collect the Christmas tree decorations.\\n- Next, stand in front of the ladder, then click on the tree to start decorating. You’ll need to decorate it 5 times to make it look perfect.\\n- After the tree is decorated, it’s time to set up the Christmas dinner. Go to the pantry, take a plate, then bring it to the table. Repeat this process until the entire table is set.\\n- Once everything is ready, your friends will arrive at the party. Congratulations, you’ve won the game and earned your prizes!",
  "24xmas04B.title": "Twelve Tasks of Xmas!",
  "25Olympus01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_sept25olympus.png",
  "25Olympus01.text": "Welcome to the Trials of Olympus!\\nFace the legendary challenges of the gods! Defeat the resurrected creatures and prove your strength in honor of Zeus. Only the worthy can endure each stage and complete the ultimate trial!\\n\\nHow to play?\\n\\n- Pull the lever at the entrance to join the queue and start the trial.\\n- Attack the resurrected creatures by clicking on them or by pressing F.\\n- Overcome the waves of enemies.\\n- Clear each stage and unlock the divine powers granted by Olympus.\\n\\nGame Dynamics\\n\\n- Click on Zeus’s Lightning to gain godly powers for a short time.\\n- Open Pandora’s Box to gain +1 Life.\\n- When you click on a resurrected creature, your character automatically turns towards it and throws ice.\\n- If there are mobs between you and the target, the ice will not reach them.\\n- Projectiles have no limit.\\n- At the end of each stage, you gain +1 Life. When you reach the Hercules Stage, you gain +3 Lives.\\n- By clicking on yourself, you can view your Life, Score, and Kill stats.\\n- Score resets each time you are eliminated, but your Kill count remains permanent.\\n- Additionally, if you are eliminated during the Hercules Stage, you will have the option to restart directly from there when you re-enter.\\n\\nOlympus Quests\\n\\n- As you progress, new quests will be unlocked.\\n- You can track your progress from the Quests menu.\\n- Clear every stage, face Champion Hercules, and claim victory in the name of Zeus.\\n- Complete all the trials and prove yourself as a true hero of Olympus! ",
  "25Olympus01.title": "Trials of Olympus ",
  "25SID01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_SID25Game.png",
  "25SID01.text": "Before you can become an official member, you must pass a security test. Are you good enough to join them? Make sure to pass the test and show them you're a real SID expert! \\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Test your knowledge by answering the true/false questions. Click on the color tiles to submit your answer.\\n- Once you've shown you are a true expert, you will be sent on a mission to save the leaked files from falling into the wrong hands. \\n- Second mission is to save the network from the dangerous viruses. Fight the zombies by clicking on them to shoot or using the \"*\" key to attack. \\n- While waiting for the anti-virus to install, you need to hold off waves of enemies and prevent the system from being overwhelmed. \\n- In the final challenge a massive wave of virus attacks is happening. Make sure to survive for 30 seconds by either eleminating as many threats as possible or dodging them.\\n- You have 1:45min to complete the game. \\n\\nGood luck!",
  "25SID01.title": "Safer Internet Day 2025",
  "25battle01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25aug2.png",
  "25battle01.text": "h1.  Welcome to the Battle Ball challenge! \\n\\nJump into the arena and try to lock more tiles than your opponent before time runs out. Use power-ups to mess with your rival or boost your own game. You've only got 2 minutes—so move fast and think faster!\\n\\nCan you take control of the board?\\n\\nh2. How to play?\\n- Your goal is to lock more tiles than your opponent in just 2 minutes.\\n- To lock a tile, walk over it 3 times. You can also lock a full shape by walking around its outline—once that’s done, all the tiles inside will lock automatically!\\n\\nh2. Power-ups\\nPower-ups will pop up randomly during the game. To use one, just pick it up and say *\\nNote: You can only hold one power-up at a time!\\n\\n- Box of Pins: Drops 5 pins near you. If someone steps on them, they get stunned and lose points—so avoid them!\\n- Spring: For 5 seconds, every tile you step on locks instantly.\\n- Harlequin: Make your opponent colour tiles for you during 5 seconds.\\n- Flashlight: Lights up all the tiles in front of you.\\n- Cannon: Locks all the tiles in front of you—but stuns you after.\\n- Lightbulb: Lights up a bunch of tiles around you.\\n- Random: Gives you a surprise power-up from the list above.\\n",
  "25battle01.title": "Battle Ball Showdown",
  "25brazil01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25brazil01.png",
  "25brazil01.text": "You're a key part of protecting the amazing wildlife in this area. Some poachers have been spotted hurting animals and messing up the environment. We need your help to step in and save the Amazon!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Stand next to poachers to catch them.\\n- Step on fires to put them out.\\n- Say \"*\" near injured animals (look for the red arrow to know where to stand) to heal them.\\n\\nYou can do all of these at the same time—but to win, you’ll need to:\\n\\n- Catch all 4 poachers\\n- Heal X injured animals\\n- Put out all the fires\\n\\nAnd you’ve only got 1 minute and 30 seconds to do it! Good luck—and thanks for helping protect the Amazon!",
  "25brazil01.title": "Festa no Brasil!",
  "25brazil02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25brazil02.png",
  "25brazil02.text": "Sabores do Brasil!\\n\\nThink you know Brazilian culture? It’s time to prove it!\\n\\nDive into an adventure where your knowledge of Brazil’s vibrant customs will be your best ally. But there's a twist — you’re not just answering questions… you're also on a delivery mission!Race through colorful neighborhoods delivering delicious dishes. Get those orders in fast — before Caramelo, the ever-hungry (and very sneaky) street dog, catches up to you!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Go to the arrow plates and start testing your knowledge about Portuguese onomatopoeia by answering the correct answers.\\n- Once you've answered all questions correctly, you will be teleported to the next game.\\n- Guide the motorcycle by clicking in front and behind of it. In each stage, you can only move in one direction. From each direction, a dog will chase you, so don't go too slow!\\n- Your goal is to reach \"\"Bar da Loura\"\" and make two deliveries within two minutes.\\n- The dogs / ball can hit you twice. If you're hit three times, you will return to the queue to try again!\\n- If you manage to do the deliveries and arrive home within two minutes you will complete the game. Good luck!",
  "25brazil02.title": "Festa no Brasil!",
  "25brazil03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25brazil03.png",
  "25brazil03.text": "Brazilian folklore\\n\\nStep into the mysterious world of Brazilian folklore and meet the legendary trickster himself — Saci Pererê! With his whirlwind spins, single leg, and magical red cap, he’s always up to mischief… but today, you hold the power. Your mission? Steal his magical hat! But be warned, he won’t let it go without a fight.\\n\\nHold onto it, and Saci just might strike a deal. Complete his challenge, and he’ll grant you a favor in return...\\n\\nh2. How to play:\\n\\n- While Saci is sitting on the riverbank, you need to move forward when he's is not facing you. If you don’t sit (:sit) on the ground before he looks at you, Saci will catch you and you will be eliminated. Stand behind the Saci when he's not looking and click on his hat to steal it.\\n\\- Now that you have Saci's hat, he desperately wants to grant you a favor to get it back. Use the arrow plates to guide Saci to the box and give his hat back.",
  "25brazil03.title": "Festa no Brasil!",
  "25brazil04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25brazil04.png",
  "25brazil04.text": "São João!\\n\\nThe festival has begun, and the square is buzzing with music, colors, and celebration!\\n Help the locals prepare for the party, and earn your place as a true São João festival hero.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Step on the green circle to start dancing with the quadrilheiros!\\n - Only step on the tiles when they’re green. If you step on a red tile or miss a step, you’ll lose.\\n- Once you finish dancing, head to the kissing booth to collect a letter, then go to Forró do Frank and find the right person to deliver it to by sitting on one of the chairs next to the bots.\\n- After delivering the letter, help the groom escape from the police by blocking their paths.\\n- When he’s safe, step on the ring plate to complete the game! ",
  "25brazil04.title": "Festa no Brasil!",
  "25coinrush01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25augcoin.png",
  "25coinrush01.text": "Coin Rush!/n/nh1. Collect coins and avoid the raider ducks. Climb the leaderboard and gather yourself a fortune!/n/nh2. How to play?/n- Enter the game by using ticket machines/n- Use the switches to activate your ban-hammer power-up, now it's time to turn the tides!/n- Collect all bronze coins to clear the board!/n/nh2. Coin Rush Quests/nOnce you've progressed far enough in the game, more quests will become available./nSee your status in the Quests menu. Try to complete them all!/n/nh2. Leaderboard/nLand yourself on top of the leaderboard and get a badge!/nGet a top 5 spot on the leaderboard at any point and it's yours (requires a score of at least 2 000)./n",
  "25coinrush01.title": "Coin Rush",
  "25fashion01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25fashion01.png",
  "25fashion01.text": "Join the Fashion Elite!\\nShow off your styling skills and compete for a spot on the prestigious fashion team!  Pick the perfect outfit that matches the bot’s assigned theme in both style and color.\\n\\nAre you ready to dazzle Luna Duck with your impeccable fashion sense and take your place among the best? The runway awaits! \\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Choose the bag, shirt, and dress in the right style (Casual, Classic or Sport) and color.\\n- Use the arrow plates to browse options.\\n- Click on the small blocks (red, green, blue) to change colors.\\n- Click on the outfit to confirm your choice. \\n- You'll have 2 min to complete the game.\\nScoring system\\n\\n- 2 Points: Outfit matches the theme.\\n- 1 Point: Color fits the theme.\\n- 1 Bonus Point: All three items are correct in style & color.\\n\\nWinning the Challenge\\n\\n- 6+ Points: You pass and join the fashion team!\\n- Less than 6 Points: Try again for another chance!\\n- Perfect 10: Achieve fashion mastery with a flawless score!",
  "25fashion01.title": "Fashion Easter!",
  "25fashion02.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25fashion02.png",
  "25fashion02.text": "Step into the Sewing Studio!\\n\\nIn the fast-paced world of fashion, it's not just about creating designs—it's about keeping things running smoothly. Your mission? Get the sewing machines working to bring Luna McDuck’s latest collection to life!\\n\\nCan you handle the pressure, fix the broken machines, and complete the collection before time runs out?\\n\\nh2. How to Play:\\n\\n- Approach a station and sit on white stool.\\n- Type \"*\" to try turning on the machine.\\n- If the machine is working, you'll get a thumbs up.\\n- If the machine is broken, it will start smoking and show a message indicating the problem.\\n\\nMini-Games:\\n\\n- Each station has a unique mini-game that appears when a machine is broken.\\n- Two random mini-games will appear each round.\\n- Complete the mini-game to fix the machine.\\n- Once all machines are fixed and working, sit on the chair at the top desk (office area) to win!",
  "25fashion02.title": "Fashion Easter!",
  "25fashion03.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25fashion03.png",
  "25fashion03.text": "The Battle for Luna begins!\\n\\nIn this high-stakes style showdown, you must assemble the perfect runway and claim victory! Hunt for the right stage elements, mix and match with precision, and create a breathtaking fashion spectacle that fits the theme.\\n\\nWill your vision outshine the competition and win Luna's favor? Let the battle for fashion supremacy begin!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- The bot will give you a theme and you'll have 2:30 mins to choose 8 matching furni items for the runway scene.\\n - Use the arrows (< and >) to browse items and the pink button to select.\\n- Once your setup is complete, press the green button to finish the game. \\n- If you completed the set with the correct items, you'll win your prize. \\n- Use the red button to restart the game.\\n- Need a hint? Check the Builders Club Shop for guidance! ",
  "25fashion03.title": "Fashion Easter!",
  "25fashion04.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25fashion04.png",
  "25fashion04.text": "Welcome to the Final Showdown: The Runway Challenge!\\n\\nThe stage is set for the ultimate test of creativity. Two fashion powerhouses are vying for Luna's talents, and it's up to you to guide her models through the final obstacle course.\\n\\nWill Luna choose sophistication or break the mold with bold fashion?  The runway is Luna's to conquer!\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Guide the bot \"Model\" (near Luna McDuck) to the pink tiles at the end of the runway before your opponent.\\n- Use the arrow plates to control your model.\\n- Step on green tiles to earn a bonus and throw clothes onto your opponent’s path.\\n- Collect more green tiles for extra chances to slow down your opponent!\\n- Watch out—your opponent can throw clothes onto your path too! Stepping on them freezes you for 5 seconds.\\n- Reach the pink tiles first to win the game!",
  "25fashion04.title": "Fashion Easter!",
  "25fastfood01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25augfastfood.png",
  "25fastfood01.text": "Welcome to the Fast food game! \\n\\nThe goal is simple: be the first player to successfully serve 6 plates of food to win the game!\\n\\nHow to play?\\n\\nTo serve a plate:\\n- Wait for the kitchen to prepare it. A green progress bar next to you shows when your plate will be ready.\\n- Click the drop button. Once the plate is ready, a drop button appears. Click it to release the plate, it will start falling toward the table, and the button will turn into a parachute icon.\\n- Deploy the parachute! Click the parachute button at just the right moment to safely land the plate on the table. If you're too late, the plate crashes and you’ll have to try again. If you’re on time, the plate lands safely and you earn 10 Fast Food points.If you’re the first to safely serve all 6 plates, you win the game, receive a badge, and earn an extra 100 Fast Food points!\\n\\nPower-Ups\\n\\nPower-ups give you an edge during the game! You can buy them with Fast Food points at the shop in the entrance area.\\nFirst-time players get 3 free uses of each power-up!\\n\\nBig Parasol\\n\\nWorried about timing your parachute just right? Use the Big Parasol! It lets you open the parachute at any time, even at the last second.\\nTo use it: Click the Big Parasol power-up button before opening your parachute.\\n\\nRockets\\n\\nIs someone way ahead of you? Time for sabotage! Use a Rocket to shoot down another player’s falling plate:\\n- Click the Rocket power-up button.\\n- Then click on a falling plate or the head of the player carrying it.\\n- You can only target plates that are currently falling.\\n- If successful, you earn 5 Fast Food points!\\n\\nBubble Shield\\n\\nSomeone targeting your plate? Protect it!\\nUse the Bubble Shield to block incoming rockets. Click the power-up button while your plate is falling — the shield will absorb the rocket and keep your plate safe!\\n\\nPower-Up Shop\\n\\nYou’ll find the Power-Up Shop in the entrance area of Fast Food. Here you can buy more Big Parasols, Rockets, or Bubble Shields using the Fast Food points you earn while playing.\\n\\nTo purchase:\\n- Click the button of the power-up you want.\\n- Say how many you’d like to buy.",
  "25fastfood01.title": "Fast Food",
  "25hween1.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25hween1.png",
  "25hween1.text": "The Last of Pixels\\n\\nThe Infected have taken over the hotel and chaos rules the halls. Guests have vanished, corridors are crawling with danger, and whispers say the cure is hidden deep inside. Only the bravest can fight through the madness, clear every obstacle, and recover it before the hotel is lost forever.\\nYour mission this time: help Joel survive! Hold off waves of zombies until the helicopter arrives to rescue you. Watch out, some zombies are stronger and need extra shots to take down.\\n\\nPlay Zone:\\n\\n- You can only move along the street cross. Stay cautious, dodge zombies, and survive!\\n\\nTime:\\n\\n- Zombie waves spawn every 1 minute. The total time limit is 150 seconds. The helicopter will arrive in the last 15 seconds. Get on board fast before time runs out!\\n\\nAmmo:\\n\\n- Pick up ammo floating on the ground to get 20 bullets. Check the top right corner to see your remaining bullets and health bar.\\n- To shoot at a zombie, you just got to click on them.\\n\\nHealth:\\n\\n- Look out for the health kit, which restores full health points. It spawns on the street cross every 25 seconds.\\n- Don’t let the zombies touch you or you’ll lose health points!",
  "25hween1.title": "The Last of Pixels",
  "25hween2.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25hween2.png",
  "25hween2.text": "The Last of Pixels\\n\\nThe Infected have taken over the hotel and chaos rules the halls. You're looking for your brother Bobby and trying to deliver some medicine to Lara.\\nOn your way there, you run into a horde of zombies, you're going to need to fight them of to reach Bobby and Lara .\\n\\nh2. Level 1\\n\\nZombies are starting to spawn in, you'll need a weapon to defend yourself.\\n\\n- Click on the axe to grab it.\\n- Once you've grabbed the broken axe, you can use it to stab the zombies in their heads by clicking on the zombies *when you're close to them*.\\n- Hit 10 level 1 zombies to move on to level 2.\\n\\nh2. Level 2\\n\\nA new type of zombie appears, these zombies have mushroom helmets on their heads, your broken axe won't be able to pierce those...\\n\\n- You'll need to find a new weapon, click on the bow to grab it. \\n- Once you've grabbed the bow, you can use it to shoot arrows at zombies by clicking on them.\\n- Hit 10 level 2 zombies to move on to level 3.\\n\\nh2. Level 3\\n\\nA third type of zombie appears, these have mushrooms growing out of their eye sockets, that's where you were aiming your bow...\\n\\n- Click on the gun rack to grab a gun. \\n- Once you've grabbed a gun, you can use it to shoot bullets at zombies by clicking on them.\\n- Hit 10 level 3 zombies to move on to level 4.\\n\\nh2. Level 4\\n\\nHuge zombies start appearing, their skin is extremely thick, your bullets won't pierce it...\\n\\n- Click on the jerry can to turn it into a makeshift flamethrower. \\n- Once you've grabbed it click a zombie to shoot a ray of fire towards them.\\n- Hit 10 level 4 zombies to have the teleporter to the next room appear.\\n\\nBe brave and good luck on your journey!",
  "25hween2.title": "The Last of Pixels",
  "25hween3.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25hween3.png",
  "25hween3.text": "The Pixel!\\n\\nYou’ve made it to the final part, now it’s time to hunt down the cure and wipe out The Infected who’ve taken over the hotel!\\nThe game has 4 stages, each with 4 mini games. Complete a stage and you'll reach the room with the cure.\\n\\nh2. How to play?\\n\\n- Every 5 minutes, a teleport will appear and will send you to a random stage. You’ll have 12 seconds to step in, or you’ll be back in the queue.\\n- Before a mini game starts, you’ll hear a robot voice SFX. Turn on your sound so you don’t miss it!\\n- After finishing a mini-game, you’ll get 10 seconds to hop into the teleport to move to the next room. Miss it and you’ll be sent back to the castle.\\n\\nh2. Quest:\\n\\nWant an extra challenge? Complete all 4 stages to finish the quest.\\nEach stage you beat will reward you with duckets. Make sure you enable all 4 quests before you start playing!",
  "25hween3.title": "The Pixel!",
  "25july01.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25july01.png",
  "25july01.text": "What’s the goal?\\nCover the whole board with domino pieces. Each piece covers two numbers next to each other.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n- Look at the numbers on the board.\\n- Find two numbers that are next to each other (side by side or up and down).\\n- Click or pick those two numbers to make a domino.\\n- Remember, you can only use each pair of numbers one time (So if you use a domino with 1 and 3, you can’t use 3 and 1 again.)\\n- Keep doing this until all the numbers are covered.\\n\\nTips:\\n- Start with pairs that only show up once — those are easier!\\n- Watch which pairs you already used so you don’t repeat.\\n",
  "25july01.title": "Dominosa!",
  "25xmas01A.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25xmas1A.png",
  "25xmas01A.text": "DJ Bling Team: Snowball Battle ArenaWelcome to the DJ Bling Team’s snowball arena! Make sure you’re wearing your team’s badge before entering.Your mission in this room is simple: take down Rasta Santa.h2. How to play:- Enter the arena and start throwing snowballs at the bot.- Dodge the snowballs Rasta Santa throws back at you!- If you get hit 5 times, you’ll be removed from the arena, so stay sharp!h2. VictoryLand all 10 hits before you get knocked out to win the match for the DJ Bling team.Good luck, and may your aim be on point!",
  "25xmas01A.title": "DJ Bling Team: Snowball Battle Arena",
  "25xmas01B.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25xmas1B.png",
  "25xmas01B.text": "Rasta Santa Team: Snowball Battle ArenaWelcome to the Rasta Santa Team’s snowball arena! Make sure you’re wearing your team’s badge before entering.Your mission in this room is simple: take down DJ Bling.h2. How to play:- Enter the arena and start throwing snowballs at the bot.- Dodge the snowballs DJ Bling throws back at you!- If you get hit 5 times, you’ll be removed from the arena, so stay sharp!h2. Victory:Land all 10 hits before you get knocked out to win the match for the Rasta Santa team.Good luck, and may your aim be on point!",
  "25xmas01B.title": "Rasta Santa: Snowball Battle Arena",
  "25xmas3.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25xmas3.png",
  "25xmas3.text.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25xmas3.png",
  "25xmas3.text.title": "Esophagor’s Hunger Trials",
  "25xmas3.text": "Esophagor's Hunger Trials\\n\\nChristmas is around the corner, and Esophagor is feeling hungrier than ever! Search the Money Trees for his favorite snacks and feed him before he throws a spooky holiday tantrum.\\n\\nHow to play:\\n\\n- Look out for the Esophagor's Clues. At the start of every round, Esophagor will show you the furnis he wants to eat.\\n- Watch the Money Trees. From time to time, some of the trees will start to shake mysteriously.\\n- Destroy the Shaking Trees. Once you see a tree shaking, run to it and click it repeatedly until the health bar reaches zero.\\n- Collect the Dropped Furnis and Feed the Esophagor. Bring the correct ones to the Esophagor to please him, but beware: feeding him the wrong items will make him ANGRY!\\n\\nLooking for an extra challenge?\\n\\nComplete the quest to earn an additional exclusive badge!",
  "25xmas3.title": "Esophagor’s Hunger Trials",
  "25xmas4.image": "web_promo_small/spromo 25xmasmaze.png",
  "25xmas4.text": "Welcome to the Christmas Village Maze!Explore the snowy village, stop by DJ Bling’s and Rasta Santa’s cottages, and track down all the hidden items for your team.Make sure you keep your team badge on at all times. There are 10 items to collect. Good luck, and try not to get lost!",
  "25xmas4.title": "Welcome to the Christmas Village Maze!",
  "26dotsgame.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_dotsgame.png",
  "26dotsgame.text": "Welcome to Dots! Your goal is simple: connect dots of the same color to turn them into points and reach the target score before you run out of moves or time\\n\\nh2. How to Play\\n\\n- Click a dot, then connect adjacent dots (up/down/left/right) of the same color.\\n- Select at least 2 dots to score\\n- Press green to confirm (uses 1 move) or red to cancel.\\n\\nNew dots fall after each move. Every game starts with a random board.\\n\\nh2. Limits:\\n\\n- You'll have 30 moves\\n- The game lasts 2 min 30 sec\\n- Anti-AFK: 20 sec (10 sec warning)\\n\\nCheck out the scoreboard to see who's leading the game with the highest points! It’s all for fun and bragging rights only, there are no extra rewards for ranking positions.",
  "26dotsgame.title": "Connect the Dots!",
  "26gamehall.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wildlife.png",
  "26gamehall.text": "To escape the winter cold, how about a little getaway to the tropical jungle, surrounded by colourful wildlife?\\n\\nh2. How to play:\\n\\nIf you have already played the previous versions, ‘Farm in Colours’ and ‘Winter in Colours’, the game is based on the same principle.\\n\\n- Your goal is to recreate 8 different wild animal images in the badge display.\\n- Head to the huts at the top of the room, where you’ll find teleports leading to each game area.\\n- When you’re near a hut, click the ladder to climb up and take the teleport inside.\\n- Once you’ve collected all 8 badges, return to the Hall and sit on one of the chairs inside the small hut on the ground, near the little bridge, to receive a bonus prize.\\nIf you’ve missed any badges, a message will let you know which ones you’re missing.PS : if you are stuck somewhere, say: **exit**",
  "26gamehall.title": "Wild Life in Colors!",
  "26gameroom.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_wildlife.png",
  "26gameroom.text": "h2. How to play:\\n\\n- To start, move forward in the queue. When you’re the first player, click the rock seat in front of you to be teleported to the drawing area.\\n- Depending on the image, you’ll have 2 minutes or 2 minutes 30 seconds to reproduce it.\\n\\nh2. How to draw :\\n\\n- Click a colour on the palette (12 colours + 1 white to erase), then click the squares you want to colour on your platform.\\n- Once you’ve finished your drawing, click the badge display near the game counter to submit it.\\n- If you’ve made a mistake, a message will appear and you’ll be able to fix it, as long as there’s time left.\\nPS : if you want to watch your friends play, say: **look**\\nGood luck !",
  "26gameroom.title": "Wild Life in Colors",
  "26sidgame.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_sidgame.png",
  "26sidgame.text": "Test your knowledge and see if you can spot what’s Safe and what’s a Scam. Pay close attention, think smart, and prove you know how to stay safe online!\\n\\nh2. How to play:\\n\\n1) Lobby Room:\\n\\n- Start by sitting on one of the sofas in the center of the lobby and listen carefully to the speeches given by Frank or Piccolo.\\n- Once all messages have finished, you will be automatically teleported to the next room.\\n2) Queue Room:\\n\\n- There, use the classic BB ticket to join the queue and wait patiently for your turn.\\n3) Scam or Safe?:\\n\\n- When you enter the game area, different scenarios will be acted out in front of you.\\n- After each one, Frank will ask “Scam or Safe?”\\n- Choose your answer by pressing the red button for Scam or the green button for Safe.\\n- Identify all 6 scenarios correctly in order to win, one wrong answer will get you eliminated, so think carefully!\\n",
  "26sidgame.title": "Welcome to Safer Internet Day!",
