  "nov25_fruitchase.text": "How to play\\n\\nUse one of the arrow pads or click around the Shoyru to change the direction the Shoyru is moving in. The goal is to collect as many Doughnutfruits as possible! But be careful, Blue Doughnutfruits are poisonous!\\n\\nFish Doughnutfruit: +5 points\\nGreen Doughnutfruit: +10 points\\nYellow Doughnutfruit: + 30 points\\nIcy Doughnutfruit: +60 points\\nGolden Doughnutfruit: +150 points\\nBlue Doughnutfruit: GAME OVER\\n\\nAvoid hitting the walls, bushes and your own eggs!\\n\\nh2. Difficulty selection\\n\\nYou can choose between 3 difficulties:\\n\\nEasy: The field contains no bushes\\nNormal: The field contains a simple bushes maze\\nHard: The field contains a harder bushes maze\\n\\nTo choose your difficulty, click the corresponding Shoyru within 15 seconds of entering the game room:\\n\\nEasy: Blue\\nNormal: Yellow\\nHard: Red",
  "nov25_fruitchase.title": "Fruit Chase",
  "nov25_petpetherder.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25herdergame3.png",
  "nov25_petpetherder.text": "The Esophagor is starving. Rumor has it that pets make it ill, but desperation seems to have set in—Babaas are on the menu and you need to rescue them! How to play Click to move your Poogle. Retrieve and bring Babaas to the pen before the Esophagor catches them! Use open paths on the edges to teleport across the field! Grab Unguberries for a speed boost and Sniddberries to stop the Esophagor and Babaas for a moment.",
  "nov25_petpetherder.title": "Petpet Herder",
  "nov25_potatocounter.image": "web_promo_small/spromo_25potatogame2.png",
  "nov25_potatocounter.text": "*How to play*Count potatoes that fly across the game field. Don't count the bad, green potatoes!After you've seen the potatoes, you have 10 seconds to write your answer in numbers.Complete all game quests to claim yourself a badge!",
  "nov25_potatocounter.title": "Ultimate Potato Counter",
