  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431403209.hint": "The purpose of the Battle Banzai game is to gain points by locking arena tiles. A tile changes color when you bounce over it. A tile is locked after being bounced on three times by the same team. Now lock some tiles by bouncing on them. Note that you cannot lock tiles if the game is not running.",
  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431403209.name": "Lock Some Tiles",
  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431566840.completed": "Good stuff! Use the puck to color tiles faster. When pushed, the puck will color the tiles it crosses with your team color. More points less work MWA HA HA!",
