  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431566840.hint": "Find a Battle Banzai game with a puck and push the puck around a few times. Push the puck by double-clicking it or by bouncing over it.",
  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431566840.name": "Push Banzai Puck",
  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431716425.completed": "You did it. The key of Battle Banzai success is to lock multiple tiles simulatenously by surrounding them. This way you get more points with less work.",
  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431716425.desc": "Surround at least 1 tile with locked tiles in your color.",
  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431716425.hint": "Surround an area with locked tiles in your color. When you lock the last tile so that an area is completely surrounded, all the surrounded tiles will get locked too. Now try that!",
  "quests.BATTLE24.1720431716425.name": "Lock Area",
