  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746711612091.completed": "That's it! Now you are set to start your amazing trip!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746711612091.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746711612091.hint": "You received an amazing proposal from Gabriela. Maybe it's a good idea to get some rest before you start this adventure!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746711612091.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746712804045.completed": "This is better and you look great!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746712804045.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746712804045.hint": "Gabriela is taking you to the forest to find some of the most beautiful local animals. Those flip flops are not appropriate. Get the right clothes for this adventure.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746712804045.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746717851682.completed": "They're beautiful, aren't they?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746717851682.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746717851682.hint": "You have to be patient and have a little bit of luck to find special animals in the wild. But I'm sure you'll find this beautiful feline.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746717851682.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746786217328.completed": "So much fun!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746786217328.desc": "Só no sapatinho...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746786217328.hint": "In Brasil, you can find many types of dance and it's a reason for locals to get together. Put on your good shoes and find a party to learn some new moves!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746786217328.name": "Let's dance!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746787012834.completed": "So cute! You can find \"caramelos\" everywhere.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746787012834.desc": "Brazilians are famous for creating memes on the internet...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746787012834.hint": "This dog got super famous because of a meme on the internet. Should you find him to recreate the meme of dancing together on a video for your socials?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746787012834.name": "Meme Culture",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746788746138.completed": "Well done!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746788746138.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746788746138.hint": "Something wild is hiding in this Fauna Crate! Place it in your room to find out what's inside!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746788746138.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789171932.completed": "You got there in no time!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789171932.desc": "Try a different kind of public transportation",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789171932.hint": "Gabriela invited you to a beach day, but your hotel is a bit far away and it’s rush hour. How about trying a motorcycle taxi?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789171932.name": "Getting at the beach",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789831385.completed": "Such a lovely time!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789831385.desc": "Let's have some fun by the ocean.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789831385.hint": "Gabi is waiting for you at the beach. Wear your best beach outfit to be by the ocean.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789831385.name": "Beach time!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789926395.completed": "A beautiful bloom revealed!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789926395.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789926395.hint": "This crate is blooming with mystery. Set it in your room and see what blossoms!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746789926395.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790254741.completed": "After so much food, maybe it's good to walk for a little bit!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790254741.desc": "Gabriela and you are hungry!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790254741.hint": "In Brazil, you can buy almost anything at the beach. Let's try some local snacks.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790254741.name": "Let's have a bite!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790524293.completed": "Amazing!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790524293.desc": "It's like a painting in the sky!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790524293.hint": "The sunsets at the beach are beautiful. Walk by the boardwalk and enjoy the moment the day gives space for the night to begin.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790524293.name": "Sunset at the beach",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790719513.completed": "They're beautiful, aren't they?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790719513.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790719513.hint": "This crate is filled with exotic flowers! Click on them to complete the quest.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746790719513.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791314663.completed": "Amazing!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791314663.desc": "Let's cool down a bit...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791314663.hint": "Gabi is waiting for you with some friends and it's very hot. Why don't you invite everyone for some ice cream?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791314663.name": "It's very hot in here...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791769765.completed": "Quest complete! The secrets of the jungle waterfall are yours!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791769765.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791769765.hint": "The mighty Iguazu Falls are a must-see! Tap on the jungle waterfall and uncover the secrets hidden within!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746791769765.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792202020.completed": "Great work! You've earned the animals' trust.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792202020.desc": "Let's explore the Nature side of this country!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792202020.hint": "Always keep some fruits or veggies at hand during your travels. The forest animals will be grateful for a snack.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792202020.name": "First week in Brasil: Nature",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792428386.completed": "You have been adopted by some locals!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792428386.desc": "Friendship is everything!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792428386.hint": "It's pretty easy to make friends in Brasil. How about you make some new friends while you are here?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792428386.name": "Making new friends",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792812578.completed": "So much affection!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792812578.desc": "Kisses, kisses and more kisses.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792812578.hint": "When you meet someone here, it's very common to give and receive kisses. Some places they give just one, others two, and it can also get to 3 kisses. How about surrendering to this local tradition?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1746792812578.name": "Muack...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747229671557.completed": "Enjoy the ride!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747229671557.desc": "The van is waiting for you to take you there!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747229671557.hint": "This week Gabi invited you to go to her uncle's farm near a small town on the countryside. Hurry up, the van is waiting to get you there!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747229671557.name": "Exploring the countryside",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747231107646.completed": "Ready to hear them?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747231107646.desc": "Let's get around the bondfire and hear some stories.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747231107646.hint": "Get a place by the fire to hear some good folklore and farm stories.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747231107646.name": "Bonfire stories",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747233119902.completed": "So beautiful!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747233119902.desc": "She became a beautiful flower...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747233119902.hint": "Naiá was in love with Jaci (the moon). Unfortunately, she lost her life trying to reach Jaci's reflection in the river. Jaci admired her so she transformed her in a beautiful flower. Can you find one of them?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747233119902.name": "Naiá & Jaci",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747234050720.completed": "He's very handsome!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747234050720.desc": "He's out there...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747234050720.hint": "Check if the legends are true and find the Boto Rosa. He must be at some party around the hotel.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747234050720.name": "It's Full MOon tonight...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747729608266.completed": "Gorgeous!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747729608266.desc": "She's beautiful and her singing is hypnotising.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747729608266.hint": "How about you try a mermaid look?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747729608266.name": "Iara the mermaid",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747731031522.completed": "He wasn't expecting this!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747731031522.desc": "Let's trap him...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747731031522.hint": "The Saci is known for being mischievous. You can steal his magical hat, or you can trap him. You just need a bottle. Find one!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747731031522.name": "Saci-Pererê",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747733272352.completed": "So scary!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747733272352.desc": "Defender of the fields.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747733272352.hint": "She is a flaming snake with eyes everywhere that defend the fields from criminal fires. Could you find her in the fields?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747733272352.name": "Boitatá",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747735898790.completed": "Oh, forgot to mention, his feet are the other way around to trick those who try to follow him. That's why you couldn't find him.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747735898790.desc": "Protector of the forest",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747735898790.hint": "Many have tried to find him in the woods and many have failed. What about you follow his footprints to see if you can do what others couldn't?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747735898790.name": "Curupira",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747737479063.completed": "Sweet dreams!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747737479063.desc": "...or the Cuca will come for you!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747737479063.hint": "She's evil and don't like kids that misbehave. Better to find a place to sleep asap!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747737479063.name": "Sleep little baby...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747738590563.completed": "Don't forget to deliver your present to her, or you'll be in a big problem!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747738590563.desc": "She likes gifts...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747738590563.hint": "Matinta Perera usually exchange favors for gifts. Find something to give her so you can ask for a favor.",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747738590563.name": "Matinta Perera",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747754142320.completed": "You look great!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747754142320.desc": "Let's dress up for the ocasion!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747754142320.hint": "You need to change, the party is about to start!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747754142320.name": "Dress to party!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747813679947.completed": "Have you got any message back?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747813679947.desc": "Join this \"Festa Junina\" tradition...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747813679947.hint": "One of the activities at this party is to write a kind of a love note to someone and ask the fancy mailman to deliver it. Who doesn't like to get a note with a positive message, right? Join the fun!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747813679947.name": "Fancy Mail",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747814316428.completed": "Awesome! It looks great!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747814316428.desc": "Let's prepare the \"Festa Junina\" party!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747814316428.hint": "Gabi asked you to help her to prepare her neighborhood party. Can you start hanging the Festa Lanterns and the Festa Bunting please? ",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747814316428.name": "Party Time!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816031455.completed": "Thank you so much!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816031455.desc": "Where is that booth?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816031455.hint": "Apparently, no one can find the fishing booth. Can you help find it please?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816031455.name": "Helping out",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816677435.completed": "Muack...",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816677435.desc": "It's your turn!",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816677435.hint": "The kissing booth needs someone there. Can you cover it for a while please?",
  "quests.festabrasil_25.1747816677435.name": "Helping out",
