  "quests.lympix24.1719820686480.completed": "Great! You're ready to run! Time to find a trainer!",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820686480.desc": "Welcome to the HabboSports! Change into training gear.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820686480.hint": "Change your looks to prepare for the games. Running shoes, shorts and a t-shirt will be a nice touch.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820686480.name": "GET READY",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820773765.completed": "Excellent! You completed 2 of 16. Now its time to start training.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820773765.desc": "Track down a Health Nut in the hotel.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820773765.hint": "Before you get going, you really need a coach and some proper training. Track down a Health Nut in the hotel.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820773765.name": "MEET THE COACH",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820868701.completed": "Bravo! You completed 3 of 16. Now head to Greece where the games began.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820868701.desc": "Start your training. Walk on rollers for 30 seconds.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820868701.hint": "Find 2 or more rollers, and try to stay on them for 30 seconds.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719820868701.name": "START TRAINING",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821391299.completed": "Congrats! You completed 4 of 16. It's time to light the torch.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821391299.desc": "Head to Greece where the Olympics got started ages ago",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821391299.hint": "Find a room with at least 4 Greek pillars, 2 Greek corners and a Greek gate",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821391299.name": "GO TO GREECE",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821586933.completed": "Wow! You completed 5 of 16. Time to start the relay.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821586933.desc": "In the spirit of the ancient Olympians, light a torch!",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821586933.hint": "Find a Habbo-lympic Torch and double-click on it to receive a torch.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821586933.name": "LIGHT THE TORCH",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821698775.completed": "Great Singing! You completed 6 of 16. Now its time to pass the torch.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821698775.desc": "It's time to sing the Olympic hymn... in Greek!",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821698775.hint": "Find the Greek lyrics of the Olympic hymn, and recite the first line (five words) while holding a torch. Hint: Wikipedia may be helpful :)",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821698775.name": "THE OLYMPIC HYMN",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821850124.completed": "Good job! You completed 7 of 16. Next stop is the dessert.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821850124.desc": "Feeling tired? Rest up after passing the torch to 5 Habbos.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821850124.hint": "Pass a torch to 5 other Habbos.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719821850124.name": "PASS THE TORCH",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822053360.completed": "Well done! You completed 12 of 16. Now go get a torch.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822053360.desc": "Get the Olympic flame to next stop: Paris.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822053360.hint": "Hold a torch and enter a French room with at least one Attic Room, one Fresh Bread Cart and one Street Artist Display.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822053360.name": "THRU FRANCE",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822349585.completed": "Nicely Done! You completed 9 of 16. Now head to the Jungle for the next step.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822349585.desc": "Lend a helping hand. Its your turn to carry the torch.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822349585.hint": "Receive a torch from 5 other Habbos.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822349585.name": "RECEIVE THE TORCH",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822463119.completed": "Excellent! You completed 8 of 16. Half way there! Now keep on running.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822463119.desc": "Feeling warm? According to the map, you're near a desert.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822463119.hint": "Hold a torch and enter a desert room with at least 5 sand patches.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822463119.name": "THRU THE DESERT",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822880894.completed": "Nice work! You completed 11 of 16. Now head to France for the next step.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822880894.desc": "Feeling tired again?! Rest up after passing the torch.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822880894.hint": "Pass a torch to 10 other Habbos.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822880894.name": "HAND OVER THE TORCH",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822961858.completed": "Great! You completed 10 of 16. Now go get the torch and head to the stadium.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822961858.desc": "Don't get lost in the jungle!",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822961858.hint": "Hold a torch and enter a jungle room with at least 5 jungle patches.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719822961858.name": "THRU THE JUNGLE",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823276647.completed": "Got it! You completed 13 of 16. Now head to the Stadium.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823276647.desc": "It's the home stretch. Take the torch for a final run.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823276647.hint": "Receive a torch from 10 other Habbos.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823276647.name": "TAKE THE TORCH BACK",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823346240.completed": "Excellent! You completed 14 of 16. You're close to the finish line.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823346240.desc": "Get to the Stadium on time!",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823346240.hint": "Hold a torch and enter a room with at least 10 sports tracks and a goal post.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719823346240.name": "THE STADIUM",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824241628.completed": "Fantastic! You completed 15 of 16. The podium is really close, can you feel it?",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824241628.desc": "Before you reach the podium you need to jump some hurdles.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824241628.hint": "Walk over (jump) at least 10 hurdles.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824241628.name": "JUMP!",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824316428.completed": "Amazing! 16 of 16 completed. Thanks to you, the HabboSports is a success.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824316428.desc": "Nice! Stand on the podium and enjoy the moment with friends!",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824316428.hint": "Hold a torch while standing on a podium in a room with at least 20 other Habbos that are all holding torches as well.",
  "quests.lympix24.1719824316428.name": "THE GRAND FINAL",
