  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1728982970340.chaincaption": "The Rise of Glatiadors",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1728982970340.chaininfo": "Let's get back to Rome this week!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1728983044600.completed": "Every journey starts with a decision! Good luck!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1728983044600.desc": "Before anything you need to opt in",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1728983044600.hint": "Go to the Coliseum and let everyone know that you are going to be a gladiator by saying \"I'm a gladiator!\".",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1728983044600.name": "Starting as a Gladiator",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732446550.completed": "Muscles are a must!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732446550.desc": "You need to be prepared to the task ahead",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732446550.hint": "You need to start training for your big day in the arena. ",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732446550.name": "Let's start the training",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732539515.completed": "These skills are not to drive old ladies around the Coliseum...",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732539515.desc": "Let's learn how to drive a Chariot",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732539515.hint": "Learn how to drive an Ancient Greek Chariot. People say it takes some time to master this task...",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732539515.name": "Learning to drive",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732643696.completed": "Now you have some animal instinct!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732643696.desc": "You never know what you'll find in the arena",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732643696.hint": "Sometimes you can find some wild beats in the arena, so you need to be familiar with the way they move. Find some animals to train yourself and anticipate their moves in combat. ",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732643696.name": "Dominating the beasts",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732780340.completed": "You are a good rider!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732780340.desc": "Get on your horse, Gladiator",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732780340.hint": "You never know when you'll need to go horse riding in the arena.",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732780340.name": "Dominating the beasts II",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732895571.completed": "You look tough!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732895571.desc": "Get dressed for the arena",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732895571.hint": "Proper attire is needed. It's a matter of life and dead.",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730732895571.name": "Time to get dressed",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733045658.completed": "You're ready, Gladiator!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733045658.desc": "Time to choose your weapon",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733045658.hint": "Get a weapon! The Coliseum is about to open its doors for the batles.",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733045658.name": "Get armed",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733185349.chaincaption": "Life as a Roman Emperor",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733185349.chaininfo": "Let's find out how life is on the other side",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733322002.completed": "Who's the Emperor? You are!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733322002.desc": "Perception is everything!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733322002.hint": "You can't be an Emperor dressed like that! Change your clothes and show everyone who's the boss around here!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730733322002.name": "Live as an Emperor",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734051500.completed": "Batteries recharged!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734051500.desc": "Let's have a taste of the other side...",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734051500.hint": "Get some rest of the political life and enjoy some time off laying down after a busy day in Coliseum's arena.",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734051500.name": "Live as an Emperor",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734319987.completed": "Who will win?",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734319987.desc": "There is only one thing left to do...",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734319987.hint": "Let the gladiators enter the arena!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734319987.name": "The show must begin",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734448261.completed": "Thank you Milord!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734448261.desc": "Show some mercy...",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734448261.hint": "Show that you are merciful and let the gladiator live saying it and giving him a thumb's up. ",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730734448261.name": "The good Emperor",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735228552.completed": "So exiting!",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735228552.desc": "The show can only begin if you are there",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735228552.hint": "Everyone is waiting in the Coliseum for you! ",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735228552.name": "Where is the Emperor?",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735811434.completed": "Best seat in the house, right?",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735811434.desc": "The show is about to start",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735811434.hint": "Get to the Coliseum and get in place to watch the show. ",
  "quests.nov24_gladiator.1730735811434.name": "Take your rightful place",
